  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A currency other than the US Dollar."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference interest rate used as a starting point for calculating the loan's interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan facility where the loan is denominated in a currency other than the US Dollar."&lt;SEP&gt;"In the case of Loans denominated in any Alternative Currency, such request shall be ineffective."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans be made in a currency other than US Dollars and the currencies specifically listed in the definition of “Alternative Currency”"&lt;SEP&gt;"a currency other than the US dollar, used for loans"&lt;SEP&gt;"disbursements and payments in an Alternative Currency"&lt;SEP&gt;"not later than the Applicable Time specified by the Administrative Agent in the case of any Loan denominated in an Alternative Currency."&lt;SEP&gt;"the currency that may be exchanged into US Dollars."</data>
