  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference interest rate used as a starting point for calculating the loan's interest rate, in this case, the TIBO Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference interest rate used as a starting point for calculating the loan's interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The TIBO Rate, with respect to any Loan or Borrowing denominated in Yen."&lt;SEP&gt;"each Lender shall be deemed to have funded each Term Benchmark Loan made by it at the Term SOFR, the EURIBO Rate, the TIBO Rate, the CDO Rate or the AUD Bank Bill Rate for such Loan, as applicable"&lt;SEP&gt;"the Tokyo Interbank Offered Rate, a benchmark interest rate"&lt;SEP&gt;"with respect to any Term Benchmark Borrowing denominated in Yen for any Interest Period, the TIBO Screen Rate at approximately 11:00 a.m., Tokyo time, two Business Days prior to the commencement of such Interest Period."</data>
