<node id="&quot;AFFILIATES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal business entity or corporation that engages in commercial, industrial, or professional activities. This term often refers to any organization recognized as a distinct legal entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Affiliates are entities that are related to the Company or the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that are affiliated with the borrowers or lenders, including subsidiaries, parent companies, or other related entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Affiliates of the Lenders and the Administrative Agent are entities that are related to the Lenders and the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The assignee of such interest shall be deemed to be a Defaulting Lender for all purposes of this Agreement until such compliance occurs, and shall not be an Affiliate of the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"entities related to or associated with the borrowers or lenders, which may have interests or obligations in connection with the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"to assign its rights and obligations hereunder to another of its offices, branches or Affiliates"</data>
