<node id="&quot;REVOLVING CREDIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of credit arrangement that allows the borrower to draw down, repay, and re-draw funds over a specified period."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of credit arrangement that allows the borrower to draw, repay, and redraw funds over a specified period."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of credit facility provided by JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of credit facility provided by The Toronto-Dominion Bank, New York Branch to Amazon.com, Inc."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of credit facility that allows the borrower to borrow and repay funds repeatedly, subject to the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of credit facility that allows the borrower to draw and repay funds over a period of time."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of credit facility that allows the borrower to draw and repay funds repeatedly."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of credit facility that allows the borrower to draw down, repay, and re-draw funds over the life of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan that allows the borrower to draw down, repay, and re-draw funds over a specified period."&lt;SEP&gt;"The FIVE-YEAR REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT provides a revolving credit facility to AMAZON.COM, INC.."&lt;SEP&gt;"The agreement is a revolving credit facility, allowing Amazon.com, Inc. to borrow and repay funds over the five-year term."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific type of credit facility provided by Standard Chartered Bank to Amazon.com, Inc."&lt;SEP&gt;"The type of credit facility provided by Bank of America N.A. to Amazon.com, Inc."&lt;SEP&gt;"The type of credit facility provided by the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The type of credit provided by Wells Fargo Bank, N.A."&lt;SEP&gt;"The type of credit provided in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1aa609ce53c934cf0d4d4925a1dc81b3274e7a1c7f3122ebf103aa191c09b5c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-913dc70008f5f7c8ec790c2d3c3bf56a7ce9ae659f1beb24fec703fc8ec5fb18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-619d0161bc5810a5abb25244b72fa59da189e925c4b29d39e99929dde9dc342e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfab8e567e4b2e5380b905a1150a53c7223642e58e7a7f29499f7f19b9bed867&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f3af823220981638c48fc83a90df748a59607384581d6688401c7c9cd5c1fd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54c6a4cbf8e57f371d8b0ff6bf25001a1063300fe0c9ec5397ddb98d526bc8df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27b7bb1eab2f386df30221441b52db7bbd2cb70270996232684fd82d606dc333&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdb367995e1f9dcb1b41ec5b6e071da48069b4f221492206865b14037b15cec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33bc80bf5077096a2a0b1e25dbb756b80db0d7d6596bcf7e3624d144b203f443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fb172fdc7dd11aa8c4301cdb41f98671b3363e4d4e757604b6708b833b2bf51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c32dd616613b7cde01b80f0ad638cff031a46b8683d1644af6b23cceff4eae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4dd848570043f1ce9e6de38d8ba9c86222a9c152a2809befbd0a785a3e278609&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45129efc91c185030848e31c5d56e89153e563c756c35b25bf656e474bf2d270&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a4816968ed32808241c34bb92596fb7f2401d39587ed67758b4ba7b99610321&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9e5415fdefa5d7b60b532bf240d882cd80d500e82755b28327141429bd737a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99fca5514203c82284d615b343bef86be2508efddc2c338557ba897c36b9419f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-328112be8eae1ba952b0aba11f7a67d95621188d8c343d98d4aa81c51337af27</data>
