<node id="&quot;INTEREST PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A detailed timeline that outlines key dates and deadlines related to the credit agreement, including repayment dates, interest payment intervals, and compliance milestones."&lt;SEP&gt;"A period of time during which interest accrues on a Loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"A period of time during which interest is calculated and paid on a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"If the applicable Borrower requests a borrowing of, conversion to or continuation of Term Benchmark Loans in any such Loan Notice, but fails to specify an Interest Period, it will be deemed to have specified an Interest Period of one month."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent may modify the definition of “Interest Period” for any Benchmark settings at or after such time to remove such unavailable or non-representative tenor."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent shall, promptly upon request, notify the Company and the Lenders of the interest rate applicable to any Interest Period for Term Benchmark Loans upon determination of such interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Interest Period is the period of time during which interest is calculated on the Loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The period of time during which the loan bears interest at a specific rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"a period of time used to determine the interest rate"&lt;SEP&gt;"any continuation, conversion, payment or prepayment of any Term Benchmark Loan on a day other than the last day of the Interest Period for such Loan"&lt;SEP&gt;"the Interest Period for which Term SOFR Reference Rate is applicable."&lt;SEP&gt;"the date of the commencement of the initial Interest Period therefor"&lt;SEP&gt;"the period commencing on the date such Term Benchmark Loan is disbursed or converted to or continued as a Term Benchmark Loan and ending on the date one, two or three months thereafter"&lt;SEP&gt;"the period for which interest is calculated on a loan"&lt;SEP&gt;"the period of time during which interest is calculated on a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"the period of time over which interest is calculated for a loan"&lt;SEP&gt;"the period over which interest is calculated"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b0b12585f6502351b0e84ecc60e47e6640828e4339d67c9b7a3c5084dcdb713&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dff3b153ec45df711dfc884145e6bd8e5c94c750ec4b6a3dfc30192713432e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-036c3af469107c12ccd7233c14b709806175fda0a66a8e3643eda71a416404ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc3aeda4c8edfd097445eb549ccb4a90e255e5a840b3e4e803abe3a81e80fda1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c8ccb9ae0ce6b50448d0662187cdebe651dfc72a75e420e155916a8d69201a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16d059b04c3c34c79db1af5764af3652c9055fb5249d1bffe7a5c78ec492c07d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74c7dd64c93c0144d9f55b48b974a5e37304dd568fbae721d17ecdcf0d5c3da6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4c601fe8f9d4d8b25c08bf113b5bf96ae2574679bd1e9086048018d2759a602&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057f1dfd340055780e8531fd368d9afb8a7c5c552bfd91fcbb9d77cfe6ad88db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e48532ee920b5375a652dc8e8d0fdfd2761dd7785efd024ee1ed1feb0d9303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f736f0f97ea6ab8151aec215e65bbd3572402809b6e7b043f3c8ba68ed651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a164963b51c81b4b7d5b333e9db2c3903e435b22d1b0a8d407e7203d895bb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2790a1002a49b097b09cbc3582891a9773c9dc0da7cb8ba9d83655fb70f7699&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffa333ba0635dfede67f8ea5e9914c4783139c8fc1ab497336bf6f481fabdc91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a9c6ebe9b09f0c3d719105cd8ced9a6a8b5cdc9b6070153b8c9d8082f94c0d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f945709d114cee142af65ee864299dd933046f3d5c2c59a4f7e3b675e775a0db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944</data>
