  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A lender's legally binding promise to provide financing up to a specified amount under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A schedule that outlines the lender's commitments to provide financing to the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitments refer to the lenders' legally binding promise to provide financing up to a specified amount under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitments refer to the lenders' legally binding promises to provide financing up to a specified amount under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitments refer to the structured credit or loan arrangement outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"may receive interest or other payments with respect to the Loans, the Commitments and this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Commitments are terminated."</data>
