<node id="&quot;TERM BENCHMARK BORROWING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A borrowing facility that uses a term benchmark rate as its base rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of borrowing that uses a term benchmark rate, such as the CDO Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan facility where the interest rate is determined by reference to a Term Benchmark, such as the Term SOFR."&lt;SEP&gt;"a Term SOFR Borrowing, an ABBR Borrowing, a CDOR Borrowing, a EURIBOR Borrowing or a TIBOR Borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"a type of borrowing that uses a term benchmark as a reference rate"&lt;SEP&gt;"the borrowing facility that uses a term benchmark rate."</data>
