<node id="&quot;LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of credit agreement that involves borrowing and repayment of funds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitment means, as to each Lender, its commitment to make Loans to the Borrowers pursuant to Section 2.01, in an aggregate principal amount at any one time outstanding that would not result in the Revolving Credit Exposure of such Lender to exceed the US Dollar amount set forth opposite such Lender’s name on Schedule 2.01 or in the Assignment and Assumption pursuant to which such Lender becomes a party hereto, as applicable, as such amount may be adjusted from time to time in accordance with this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrowers shall prepay Loans in an aggregate amount sufficient to eliminate such excess."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loans are the amounts of money that are borrowed by the borrower under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loans are the credit facilities provided by the Lenders to the Company, and are subject to the terms and conditions of this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loans made hereunder, including the enforcement or protection of rights under this Agreement and the other Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loans refer to the credit facilities provided to the Borrowers under the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loans refer to the financial accommodations provided by the Lenders to the Borrower under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loans refer to the structured credit or loan arrangement outlined in the agreement, which defines the specific financing structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The loans made by the Lenders to the Borrowers under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The structured credit or loan arrangement outlined in the agreement, which defines the specific financing structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"all of its interests, rights (other than its existing rights to payments pursuant to Sections 3.01 and 3.04) and obligations under this Agreement and the related Loan Documents to an Eligible Assignee that shall assume such obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"declare the unpaid principal amount of all outstanding Loans, all interest accrued and unpaid thereon, and all other amounts owing or payable hereunder or under any other Loan Document"&lt;SEP&gt;"may receive interest or other payments with respect to the Loans, the Commitments and this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"the loans made under the loan agreement"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9271415b6fffe0893502dc89e3841c2be9f06f82c8c5f9489abaefaec90483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ff8bbfb0e9e2a8305cb863cbeecde68558028aed4c696e7b848831bc7f03992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26b5126e4c1e707b1bbe422f1a41e0d0cc8063a093ce84f380bccb1d3545594&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a3d2b24cfcf893da9826354352f4a7639afec65277f7fddb2b7adfc118840d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c6571d7017e85d1e7eca3e535c4971d4e40eee95a434accc5984191595984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2e35c49fdc82fe469355cd3f4a7d66ac4e1caf86823c8a1f714e6758a00f72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6e8743e0fed11cf1e7302388e7b8f38f70918d5b087d464be884bffcad84ea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9642d5dbe46eea76db5bf5d1ab9b32111e99d996ae540a37b6c308a64367cbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09e9c5e5b8a7a8f4ad5eb675c75b46dfea2876894f750bdb96a586997b962e8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b366223ffce1d243cf104dd968c58e4e03ce0ef2716ea0865cb3ed376a6e0bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc654eb29e972ffacdcbd1b1689d14682e8ad53b669e5b7b8a2de0e843401cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cf30aa371483ffc5e424225ef332db8adf37eeb6519c28e0905154c67a5e75e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-279401c1a592881eefdbd927f41151f279903f6314ebe85d3fb4bab5d68a081e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e425af2e275bc52ded23404cc180bda000dd6a0c5f29625d84cb283b1e6497a6</data>
