<node id="&quot;LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A law is a regulation that governs the behavior of individuals and companies."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of regulation or rule that governs and regulates credit agreements and financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any law or regulation that applies to the agreement or the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the authorities or bodies responsible for overseeing and enforcing compliance with laws, rules, and regulations that govern credit agreements and financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the laws, rules, and regulations that govern credit agreements and financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent shall not be required to take any action that, in its opinion or the opinion of its counsel, may expose the Administrative Agent to liability or that is contrary to any Loan Document or applicable Law."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Law refers to the applicable laws and regulations that govern the credit agreement."</data>
