<node id="&quot;FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MARGIN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Charges or payments made in relation to a loan or credit arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fees refer to the amounts paid by the Borrowers for the services provided by the Lenders and the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Fees refer to the additional percentage added to the base rate benchmark to arrive at the final interest rate on the loan, which compensates the lender for credit risk and administrative costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The additional percentage added to the base rate benchmark to arrive at the final interest rate on the loan. This margin compensates the lender for credit risk and administrative costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The additional percentage added to the base rate benchmark to arrive at the final interest rate on the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2ff8bbfb0e9e2a8305cb863cbeecde68558028aed4c696e7b848831bc7f03992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c6571d7017e85d1e7eca3e535c4971d4e40eee95a434accc5984191595984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d83e1d187f97b9d479a02987af469379777e335a03f2f4a566b855662bde5347&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc654eb29e972ffacdcbd1b1689d14682e8ad53b669e5b7b8a2de0e843401cc2</data>
