  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference interest rate used as a starting point for calculating the loan's interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate per annum equal to the highest of the NYFRB Rate, the Prime Rate, and the Term SOFR for a one month Interest Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"the base interest rate used to calculate the Default Rate"</data>
