<node id="&quot;SIGNATURE PAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A page where the parties involved in the credit agreement sign to indicate their agreement to the terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The page where the agreement is signed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The page where the authorized signatory signs the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The page where the parties sign the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The page where the parties sign the five-year revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The page where the signatures of the parties are recorded."&lt;SEP&gt;"The page where the signatures of the parties involved are recorded."&lt;SEP&gt;"The page where the signatures of the parties involved in the credit agreement are recorded."&lt;SEP&gt;"The signature page is a document that confirms the agreement."</data>
