<node id="&quot;MATURITY DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATURITY DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"If Lenders constituting not less than the Required Lenders shall have agreed to extend the Maturity Date before the anniversary of the Closing Date immediately following the delivery of the notice from the Company requesting such extension,"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Aggregate Commitments shall automatically terminate at 5:00 p.m., New York City time, on the Maturity Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maturity Date is the date on which the Loan is due and payable."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maturity Date is the predetermined final due date for the repayment of the loan, which signals the end of the loan term, when all outstanding principal and accrued interest must be repaid."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maturity Date refers to the final due date for the repayment of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The later of (a) November 1, 2028 and (b) if maturity is extended pursuant to Section 2.12, such extended maturity date as determined pursuant to such Section."&lt;SEP&gt;"The predetermined final due date for the repayment of the loan, signaling the end of the loan term, when all outstanding principal and accrued interest must be repaid."&lt;SEP&gt;"The predetermined final due date for the repayment of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Maturity Date; provided, however, that if any Interest Period for a Term Benchmark Loan exceeds three months, the respective dates that fall every three months after the beginning of such Interest Period shall also be Interest Payment Dates"&lt;SEP&gt;"the date on which a loan is due to be repaid"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5c8ccb9ae0ce6b50448d0662187cdebe651dfc72a75e420e155916a8d69201a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ff8bbfb0e9e2a8305cb863cbeecde68558028aed4c696e7b848831bc7f03992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25153dfc8542779016754e3a9d4ba1ff761fe00f9d01723cf4b526a3637e8e65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4c601fe8f9d4d8b25c08bf113b5bf96ae2574679bd1e9086048018d2759a602&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-287e1de5e659a7178eed8c39f284e89d7d984ce914fef63cc2925dcee357efee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c6571d7017e85d1e7eca3e535c4971d4e40eee95a434accc5984191595984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e48532ee920b5375a652dc8e8d0fdfd2761dd7785efd024ee1ed1feb0d9303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2e35c49fdc82fe469355cd3f4a7d66ac4e1caf86823c8a1f714e6758a00f72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b366223ffce1d243cf104dd968c58e4e03ce0ef2716ea0865cb3ed376a6e0bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a31d91e19f5e79dee072438030f29981db72d5f3569150ff42952e39d103036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057f1dfd340055780e8531fd368d9afb8a7c5c552bfd91fcbb9d77cfe6ad88db</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
