<node id="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"If and to the extent that the enforceability of any provisions in this Agreement relating to Defaulting Lenders shall be limited by Debtor Relief Laws, as determined in good faith by the Administrative Agent, then such provisions shall be deemed to be in effect only to the extent not so limited."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Defaulting Lenders refer to any party that is contractually obligated to fulfill the terms of the agreement, but has failed to meet their obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7a05f2d3762035b6920e2994449915a10f14de2b16d9908fab1975c1279ab5fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c6571d7017e85d1e7eca3e535c4971d4e40eee95a434accc5984191595984</data>
