<node id="&quot;PRIME RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The rate in effect on a given day, used to calculate the Base Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"a reference interest rate used as a starting point for calculating the loan's interest rate"&lt;SEP&gt;"means the rate of interest last quoted by The Wall Street Journal as the “Prime Rate” in the United States."&lt;SEP&gt;"the rate used as a reference point for determining the Base Rate"</data>
