  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 2.11 is a part of the credit agreement that outlines certain terms and conditions of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 2.11 refers to the section of this Agreement outlining the pro rata sharing of payments among the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"This Section shall supersede any provisions in Section 2.11 or 11.01 to the contrary."</data>
