<node id="&quot;DESIGNATED BORROWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Designated Borrowers are the entities designated by the Company to borrow under this Agreement, and are subject to the terms and conditions of this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Designated Borrowers refer to the individual, company, or legal entity that is designated to receive funds under the credit agreement and is responsible for repaying the loan according to the agreed terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Designated Borrowers to the Credit Parties, arising hereunder or under any other Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"the borrowers in respect of which the Guaranty is made under Article X."</data>
