<node id="&quot;TERM SOFR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference interest rate used as a starting point for calculating the loan's interest rate, in this case, the Term SOFR component of the Base Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference interest rate used as a starting point for calculating the loan's interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term SOFR means, with respect to any Term Benchmark Borrowing denominated in US Dollars and for any tenor comparable to the applicable Interest Period, the Term SOFR Reference Rate at approximately 5:00 a.m., Chicago time, two U.S. Government Securities Business Days prior to the commencement of such tenor comparable to the applicable Interest period, as such rate is published by the CME Term SOFR Administrator."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Term SOFR, with respect to any Term Benchmark Loan or Term Benchmark Borrowing denominated in US Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate for a one month Interest Period, used to calculate the Base Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"a reference rate used for calculating interest rates"&lt;SEP&gt;"each Lender shall be deemed to have funded each Term Benchmark Loan made by it at the Term SOFR, the EURIBO Rate, the TIBO Rate, the CDO Rate or the AUD Bank Bill Rate for such Loan, as applicable"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cc3aeda4c8edfd097445eb549ccb4a90e255e5a840b3e4e803abe3a81e80fda1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16d059b04c3c34c79db1af5764af3652c9055fb5249d1bffe7a5c78ec492c07d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74c7dd64c93c0144d9f55b48b974a5e37304dd568fbae721d17ecdcf0d5c3da6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-683730b045acd1f370fdaed2c7829337a50090b5804d74bf2b26500077b12189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f736f0f97ea6ab8151aec215e65bbd3572402809b6e7b043f3c8ba68ed651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057f1dfd340055780e8531fd368d9afb8a7c5c552bfd91fcbb9d77cfe6ad88db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd537df50e1543242e0c0db7ea536b0f7035562c9c32eb98a80dcee483914b78</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
