<node id="&quot;BASE RATE BORROWING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Borrowing comprised of Base Rate Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan that bears interest on the outstanding principal amount from the applicable borrowing or conversion date at a rate per annum equal to the Base Rate plus the Applicable Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"If the Daily Simple SOFR is the subject of a Benchmark Transition Event, such Loans shall on the last day of the then current Interest Period applicable thereto, unless prepaid, convert to, and shall constitute, a Base Rate Borrowing."</data>
