  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Business Days are the days on which the credit agreement is effective and payments are made."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Days are the days on which the credit agreement is in effect."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Days refer to the days on which the Administrative Agent is open for business, and are used to calculate the timing of certain events under this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Lender shall notify the Administrative Agent, not later than 1:00 p.m., New York City time, five (5) Business Days after receipt of such request"&lt;SEP&gt;"within two Business Days after receipt of such notice, the Borrowers shall prepay Loans in an aggregate amount sufficient to eliminate such excess."</data>
