  <data key="d0">"SECURED PARTY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Related Party is an entity that holds a security interest in collateral provided by the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Related Party of any of the foregoing Persons, including any Subsidiary or Affiliate thereof, any director, officer or employee."</data>
