<node id="&quot;REPAYMENT OF LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REPAYMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Repayment of Loans refers to the borrower's obligation to repay the loan according to the agreed terms, including any interest and fees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-574c6571d7017e85d1e7eca3e535c4971d4e40eee95a434accc5984191595984</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BENCHMARK TRANSITION EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An event that triggers the replacement of a Benchmark with a Benchmark Replacement."&lt;SEP&gt;"If the Daily Simple SOFR is the subject of a Benchmark Transition Event, such Loans shall on the last day of the then current Interest Period applicable thereto, unless prepaid, convert to, and shall constitute, a Base Rate Borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The earliest to occur of the following events with respect to such then-current Benchmark: (1) in the case of clause (1) or (2) of the definition of “Benchmark Transition Event”, the later of (a) the date of the public statement or publication of information referenced therein and (b) the date on which the administrator of such Benchmark (or the published component used in the calculation thereof) permanently or indefinitely ceases to provide all Available Tenors of such Benchmark (or such component thereof);"&lt;SEP&gt;"Upon the occurrence of a Benchmark Transition Event, Section 3.03(b)(i) provides a mechanism for determining an alternative rate of interest"&lt;SEP&gt;"an event that triggers the replacement of a benchmark rate"&lt;SEP&gt;"the occurrence of one or more events with respect to the benchmark"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-036c3af469107c12ccd7233c14b709806175fda0a66a8e3643eda71a416404ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc4a376d10db483b21ca8ce18794862fc9eff868acd4b16d4af5afc80bbb0b4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74c7dd64c93c0144d9f55b48b974a5e37304dd568fbae721d17ecdcf0d5c3da6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf0b74c9fd54d4358be6da80ee3ca58034fd87424426a3d8e4a476fecd29b1f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8e06f15d14c2b261e4dd5144ab3c595c16a01c4d89c05e9afcad85176811f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26e39a9e3ce38e35ba80037cbf39058662ce1dbd88dd87d6a9a695b35bb692f1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CDOR LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"If the applicable Borrower fails to specify a Type of Loan in a Loan Notice or if the applicable Borrower fails to give a timely notice requesting a conversion or continuation of any Term Benchmark Borrowing, then, subject to Section 3.03, the applicable Loans shall be made as, or continued as, CDOR Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans denominated in Canadian Dollars may only be CDOR Loans"&lt;SEP&gt;"a type of loan that uses the CDOR rate as the benchmark rate"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f945709d114cee142af65ee864299dd933046f3d5c2c59a4f7e3b675e775a0db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2790a1002a49b097b09cbc3582891a9773c9dc0da7cb8ba9d83655fb70f7699&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21e8bd401eb8d2893cda3131348d5d8ecee9345959902e114ca131d8e2d1d670</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-DEFAULTING LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Non-Defaulting Lenders are the lenders that have not failed to fund their portions of the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2a31d91e19f5e79dee072438030f29981db72d5f3569150ff42952e39d103036</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 3.04&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A clause in the credit agreement that outlines the terms and conditions for compensation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific section of the credit agreement that outlines the terms and conditions for increased costs and compensation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific promises or restrictions included in the agreement that govern the borrower's operations and financial behavior."&lt;SEP&gt;"all of its interests, rights (other than its existing rights to payments pursuant to Sections 3.01 and 3.04) and obligations under this Agreement and the related Loan Documents to an Eligible Assignee that shall assume such obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"if any Lender requests compensation under Section 3.04"&lt;SEP&gt;"such Lender shall cease to be a party hereto but shall continue to be entitled to the benefits of Sections 3.01, 3.04, 3.05, and 11.04 with respect to facts and circumstances occurring prior to the effective date of such assignment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cc3aeda4c8edfd097445eb549ccb4a90e255e5a840b3e4e803abe3a81e80fda1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1307fb50714aaa5c54a16511ecdafdda1e867cd79f4bdc3f2e60bf7361349b09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9642d5dbe46eea76db5bf5d1ab9b32111e99d996ae540a37b6c308a64367cbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd758a235fa3762ad9b4aad4608ccd04d2283533e76b28c157982eac1454264&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeefb9b088abc8d89a40d93af5939ed01899b461f9a1e8dbd62765acc3ca0f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56521f0d5861a7f4d9b333237148742c844e3d8c2104929a676973533b40aca</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"to the extent not covered by independent third-party insurance as to which the insurer has been notified and does not dispute coverage"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-09e9c5e5b8a7a8f4ad5eb675c75b46dfea2876894f750bdb96a586997b962e8c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT FACILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The credit facility is a type of facility provided by the lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The credit facility provided for herein, including the syndication and administration of the Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The five-year revolving credit agreement provides a credit facility to Amazon.com, Inc."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9cf30aa371483ffc5e424225ef332db8adf37eeb6519c28e0905154c67a5e75e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1fe0d130929db1808cc1753b17c948318cb87081241f82a4da21261bb1ad76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfab8e567e4b2e5380b905a1150a53c7223642e58e7a7f29499f7f19b9bed867</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The parties are the entities that have entered into the agreement, including AMAZON.COM, INC. and the lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2e0e7b47c7a4918aaa35cad78939f047c0807effe52b5147840dfb42902551a4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MARKET DATA COLLECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Market Data Collector is an entity that collects and provides market data."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3e06203a764e8d9f36c5cbaca7bc8741843d94e91ddf0b7cc99ff68067bbc1a5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUB-AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Credit Parties means, collectively, the Administrative Agent, the Lenders, the Indemnitees and each co-agent or sub-agent appointed by the Administrative Agent from time to time pursuant to Section 9.05."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent may perform any and all of its duties and exercise its rights and powers hereunder or under any other Loan Document by or through any one or more sub-agents appointed by the Administrative Agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-be37345534a10dfd61be5c6f2fb19d9fc32937b5ae726a29f739cc850797b27a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e425af2e275bc52ded23404cc180bda000dd6a0c5f29625d84cb283b1e6497a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of payment or obligation that the Borrower must comply with."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any and all payments by or on account of any obligation of any Borrower under any Loan Document shall be made without deduction or withholding for any Taxes, except as required by applicable Laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fees or charges imposed by governments on individuals or entities, which are excluded from Section 3.04 and governed exclusively by Section 3.01."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pay and discharge as the same shall become due and payable, all Taxes upon it or its properties or assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the authorities or bodies responsible for overseeing and enforcing compliance with laws, rules, and regulations that govern credit agreements and financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes imposed on or with respect to any Recipient or required to be withheld or deducted from a payment to a Recipient."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes, other than Excluded Taxes, imposed on or with respect to any payment made by or on account of any obligation of any Borrower under any Loan Document"&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes, other than any Taxes that represent Liabilities or related expenses arising from any non-Tax claim."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is obligated to pay all taxes and other governmental charges when due."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Taxes refer to the regulatory requirements and obligations related to taxation that apply to the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amounts paid to governmental authorities as required by law, which can impact the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"all present or future taxes, levies, imposts, duties, deductions, withholdings imposed by any Governmental Authority."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ec7874b9697abfa7fdec5c3eba7cff86c0d83eb6bd59405831eed85588e963df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b285e03d7146f17e87848eb9b5f8c15183dec4084105eaa7e79c1ad84c91367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc71017c2caaab37d172ceaf0e09b388e1dce067cbd68e8f1e99012d931b5fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ff8bbfb0e9e2a8305cb863cbeecde68558028aed4c696e7b848831bc7f03992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4c601fe8f9d4d8b25c08bf113b5bf96ae2574679bd1e9086048018d2759a602&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7db0278db53932718c0ec9229e65778e4ed2f8d1c18cc7df9db844e9044f91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c6571d7017e85d1e7eca3e535c4971d4e40eee95a434accc5984191595984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22018e046e6afa039b6c5519ad4d3d2a187b5ee53945844568160c46abb9f6a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cf30aa371483ffc5e424225ef332db8adf37eeb6519c28e0905154c67a5e75e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a9c6ebe9b09f0c3d719105cd8ced9a6a8b5cdc9b6070153b8c9d8082f94c0d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7176cf30b46b0b2bd028f692a631973b82ef94973df4a23df2be2494830423d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeefb9b088abc8d89a40d93af5939ed01899b461f9a1e8dbd62765acc3ca0f5c</data>
