<node id="&quot;DAILY SIMPLE SOFR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference interest rate used as a starting point for calculating the loan's interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"An alternative rate used in the calculation of the Benchmark Replacement."&lt;SEP&gt;"If the Daily Simple SOFR is not the subject of a Benchmark Transition Event, such Loans shall on the last day of the then current Interest Period applicable thereto, unless prepaid, convert to, and shall constitute, an RFR Borrowing denominated in US Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Daily Simple SOFR, with respect to any RFR Loan or RFR Borrowing denominated in US Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"The cost of borrowing expressed as a percentage of the principal, which may be fixed or variable, reflecting market conditions and the borrower's credit risk, in this case, the Daily Simple SOFR."&lt;SEP&gt;"an interest rate per annum equal to the greater of SOFR for the day that is five RFR Business Days prior to the SOFR Interest Day"&lt;SEP&gt;"each RFR Loan made by it at the Daily Simple SOFR, the Daily Simple SONIA or the Daily Simple SARON, as applicable"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cc3aeda4c8edfd097445eb549ccb4a90e255e5a840b3e4e803abe3a81e80fda1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-036c3af469107c12ccd7233c14b709806175fda0a66a8e3643eda71a416404ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74c7dd64c93c0144d9f55b48b974a5e37304dd568fbae721d17ecdcf0d5c3da6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064d8dd62757d82b1f21029d116981d33cf5047c69e28a4c7441d90f0d506fa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-683730b045acd1f370fdaed2c7829337a50090b5804d74bf2b26500077b12189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f736f0f97ea6ab8151aec215e65bbd3572402809b6e7b043f3c8ba68ed651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057f1dfd340055780e8531fd368d9afb8a7c5c552bfd91fcbb9d77cfe6ad88db</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
