</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Credit Parties and shall forthwith be paid to the Credit Parties to reduce the amount of the Obligations, whether matured or unmatured."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Credit Parties may, at any time and from time to time, without notice or demand, and without affecting the enforceability or continuing effectiveness hereof."&lt;SEP&gt;"the parties in favor of which the Guaranty is made under Article X."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aced5e6c50ac288864430fbe72ab45e09b7a3926dd8018932cd2f67b078cb7d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ca8d6a181a8bde7e3dabd1b9b58a0f7ae55346ce1eece1febe781b49afbd657&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-652de4f4d91e90a6f7563949dee043c59ebc83c69af5a7e4daaf8634d33d43cd</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEDERAL RESERVE BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial institution or entity that provides the loan to the borrower, responsible for disbursing funds and monitoring compliance with the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The central bank of the United States."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e56521f0d5861a7f4d9b333237148742c844e3d8c2104929a676973533b40aca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2e35c49fdc82fe469355cd3f4a7d66ac4e1caf86823c8a1f714e6758a00f72</data>
