<node id="&quot;LOAN NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A detailed timeline that outlines key dates and deadlines related to the credit agreement, including repayment dates, interest payment intervals, and compliance milestones."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal document submitted by the borrower to the lender, requesting a loan disbursement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Loan Notice must be received by the Administrative Agent not later than 1:00 p.m., New York City time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Following receipt of a Loan Notice, the Administrative Agent shall promptly notify each Lender of the details thereof."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Notice is a request for a loan made by the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"the applicable Borrower in its Loan Notice"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3a7cb2d32a014cbd8ecc96746c516faa8445dc4c74435c9e1e7a4b3dcc4bbf48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c57ca3d4b6f13c7bd1c48724f58fb0dc9179a0eb8a9db37f727f6e9c7bcca0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4c601fe8f9d4d8b25c08bf113b5bf96ae2574679bd1e9086048018d2759a602&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f736f0f97ea6ab8151aec215e65bbd3572402809b6e7b043f3c8ba68ed651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a164963b51c81b4b7d5b333e9db2c3903e435b22d1b0a8d407e7203d895bb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f945709d114cee142af65ee864299dd933046f3d5c2c59a4f7e3b675e775a0db</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
