  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An alternative rate used in the calculation of the Benchmark Replacement."&lt;SEP&gt;"the daily compounded Canadian Overnight Repo Average, a benchmark interest rate"</data>
