</node>
<node id="&quot;OVERNIGHT BANK FUNDING RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The rate at which banks lend and borrow money from each other overnight."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate comprised of both overnight federal funds and overnight eurodollar transactions denominated in US Dollars by U.S.-managed banking offices of depository institutions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f6e8743e0fed11cf1e7302388e7b8f38f70918d5b087d464be884bffcad84ea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2e35c49fdc82fe469355cd3f4a7d66ac4e1caf86823c8a1f714e6758a00f72</data>
