  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Note is a document that evidences the Loan and is executed by the Borrower in favor of the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"A debt security instrument that outlines the terms of the loan, including the principal amount, interest rate, and repayment terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal, legally binding contract outlining the rights, obligations, and terms between two or more parties, in this case, the Lenders and the Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"A promissory note made by a Borrower in favor of a Lender evidencing Loans made by such Lender to such Borrower, substantially in the form of Exhibit B."&lt;SEP&gt;"The structured credit or loan arrangement outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Upon request, each Borrower (at its expense) shall execute and deliver a Note to the assignee Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3a7cb2d32a014cbd8ecc96746c516faa8445dc4c74435c9e1e7a4b3dcc4bbf48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ff8bbfb0e9e2a8305cb863cbeecde68558028aed4c696e7b848831bc7f03992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1307fb50714aaa5c54a16511ecdafdda1e867cd79f4bdc3f2e60bf7361349b09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e48532ee920b5375a652dc8e8d0fdfd2761dd7785efd024ee1ed1feb0d9303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2e35c49fdc82fe469355cd3f4a7d66ac4e1caf86823c8a1f714e6758a00f72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56521f0d5861a7f4d9b333237148742c844e3d8c2104929a676973533b40aca</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CDO RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A rate used as a Benchmark, subject to replacement in the event of a Benchmark Transition Event."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference interest rate used as a starting point for calculating the loan's interest rate, in this case, the CDO Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference interest rate used as a starting point for calculating the loan's interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The CDO Rate, with respect to any Loan or Borrowing denominated in Canadian Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"The CDO Screen Rate rounded to the nearest 1/100 of 1.00% for any Term Benchmark Borrowing denominated in Canadian Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"a specific type of benchmark rate"&lt;SEP&gt;"each Lender shall be deemed to have funded each Term Benchmark Loan made by it at the Term SOFR, the EURIBO Rate, the TIBO Rate, the CDO Rate or the AUD Bank Bill Rate for such Loan, as applicable"&lt;SEP&gt;"the Canadian Dollar Offered Rate, a benchmark interest rate"&lt;SEP&gt;"the rate that is replaced by a Benchmark Replacement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cc3aeda4c8edfd097445eb549ccb4a90e255e5a840b3e4e803abe3a81e80fda1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16d059b04c3c34c79db1af5764af3652c9055fb5249d1bffe7a5c78ec492c07d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74c7dd64c93c0144d9f55b48b974a5e37304dd568fbae721d17ecdcf0d5c3da6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf0b74c9fd54d4358be6da80ee3ca58034fd87424426a3d8e4a476fecd29b1f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-683730b045acd1f370fdaed2c7829337a50090b5804d74bf2b26500077b12189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f736f0f97ea6ab8151aec215e65bbd3572402809b6e7b043f3c8ba68ed651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffa333ba0635dfede67f8ea5e9914c4783139c8fc1ab497336bf6f481fabdc91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057f1dfd340055780e8531fd368d9afb8a7c5c552bfd91fcbb9d77cfe6ad88db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SCHEDULE 2.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Commitment means, as to each Lender, its commitment to make Loans to the Borrowers pursuant to Section 2.01, in an aggregate principal amount at any one time outstanding that would not result in the Revolving Credit Exposure of such Lender to exceed the US Dollar amount set forth opposite such Lender’s name on Schedule 2.01 or in the Assignment and Assumption pursuant to which such Lender becomes a party hereto, as applicable, as such amount may be adjusted from time to time in accordance with this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule 2.01 is a list of Lenders that are parties to the Loan Documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c5e48532ee920b5375a652dc8e8d0fdfd2761dd7785efd024ee1ed1feb0d9303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e425af2e275bc52ded23404cc180bda000dd6a0c5f29625d84cb283b1e6497a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIECHTENSTEIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COUNTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"a country that is a member of the EEA"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b0b12585f6502351b0e84ecc60e47e6640828e4339d67c9b7a3c5084dcdb713</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACCOUNTING STANDARDS CODIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"the codification established by the Financial Accounting Standards Board."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-652de4f4d91e90a6f7563949dee043c59ebc83c69af5a7e4daaf8634d33d43cd</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REQUIRED LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A group of lenders that have a significant interest in the credit agreement and are required to make certain decisions or approvals."&lt;SEP&gt;"During the existence of an Event of Default, upon the request of the Required Lenders, (i) no Loans denominated in US Dollars shall be converted to or continued as Term Benchmark Loans without the consent of the Required Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"If Lenders constituting not less than the Required Lenders shall have agreed to extend the Maturity Date before the anniversary of the Closing Date immediately following the delivery of the notice from the Company requesting such extension,"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent has not received, by 5:00 p.m., New York City time, on the fifth Business Day after the date of the Term CORRA Notice, written notice of objection to such conversion to Term CORRA from Lenders comprising the Required Lenders or from the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent shall not be required to take any action that, in its opinion or the opinion of its counsel, may expose the Administrative Agent to liability or that is contrary to any Loan Document or applicable Law, including for the avoidance of doubt any action that may be in violation of the automatic stay under any Debtor Relief Law or that may effect a forfeiture, modification or termination of property of a Defaulting Lender in violation of any Debtor Relief Law, as directed in writing by the Required Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent shall, at the request of, or may, with the consent of, the Required Lenders, take any or all of the following actions"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders that are required to approve certain actions under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders are a group of lenders that have the right to enforce certain rights and remedies under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders are the Lenders whose consent is required for certain amendments, waivers, or consents under this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders have the authority to remove the Administrative Agent and appoint a successor, and they must consent to certain actions under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lenders that are required to approve certain actions or amendments to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Upon receipt of any such notice of resignation, the Required Lenders shall have the right, with the written consent of the Company, to appoint a successor."&lt;SEP&gt;"a group of lenders that must consent to certain changes to the credit agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"the Required Lenders shall require"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3dff3b153ec45df711dfc884145e6bd8e5c94c750ec4b6a3dfc30192713432e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-036c3af469107c12ccd7233c14b709806175fda0a66a8e3643eda71a416404ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25153dfc8542779016754e3a9d4ba1ff761fe00f9d01723cf4b526a3637e8e65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2e35c49fdc82fe469355cd3f4a7d66ac4e1caf86823c8a1f714e6758a00f72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf0b74c9fd54d4358be6da80ee3ca58034fd87424426a3d8e4a476fecd29b1f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70e66841da77e158232fc791da7ba5c83a7a4e366d94c2a604edc34cc9b427fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f736f0f97ea6ab8151aec215e65bbd3572402809b6e7b043f3c8ba68ed651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a164963b51c81b4b7d5b333e9db2c3903e435b22d1b0a8d407e7203d895bb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09e9c5e5b8a7a8f4ad5eb675c75b46dfea2876894f750bdb96a586997b962e8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-405e30a8247fa3f574e4cf704c4da2490c7b07557815fff2ebf7de66149d000a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-279401c1a592881eefdbd927f41151f279903f6314ebe85d3fb4bab5d68a081e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39903c506f2ed6e3becee13eaa6df530fdd376a6533c5d81ffd839e61ab1166c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be37345534a10dfd61be5c6f2fb19d9fc32937b5ae726a29f739cc850797b27a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3635abde8c7e5a6f484e19948315859a2e2ed6f744a89175ad7f5758f30b40f1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UK RESOLUTION AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY AUTHORITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A UK Resolution Authority with respect to any UK Financial Institution."&lt;SEP&gt;"A resolution authority located in the United Kingdom."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank of England or any other public administrative authority having responsibility for the resolution of any UK Financial Institution."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c610acc60b313ab2f0cb1618c5c144d079538d57f099e41f83a5a06f84e38ca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-683730b045acd1f370fdaed2c7829337a50090b5804d74bf2b26500077b12189</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIQUIDITY REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Regulations that require lenders to maintain a certain level of liquidity, affecting their ability to lend and the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eeefb9b088abc8d89a40d93af5939ed01899b461f9a1e8dbd62765acc3ca0f5c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAXIMUM RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The interest paid or agreed to be paid under the Loan Documents shall not exceed the maximum rate of non-usurious interest permitted by applicable Law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7a05f2d3762035b6920e2994449915a10f14de2b16d9908fab1975c1279ab5fa</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION FOR LOSSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MARGIN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Compensation for Losses refers to compensation that may be payable to the lender in the event of losses incurred as a result of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-574c6571d7017e85d1e7eca3e535c4971d4e40eee95a434accc5984191595984</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WAIVER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal decision by a party to relinquish or forego a known right or claim under the agreement, which may be granted to allow temporary flexibility in performance without altering the core terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal decision by a party to relinquish or forego a known right or claim under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal decision to relinquish or forego a known right or claim under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"the voluntary relinquishment or surrender of a right or claim by a party under the credit agreement, which may be used to resolve disputes or modify the terms of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e56521f0d5861a7f4d9b333237148742c844e3d8c2104929a676973533b40aca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-287e1de5e659a7178eed8c39f284e89d7d984ce914fef63cc2925dcee357efee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2facca2c062c9b7ce891849070758dd3706fef511167f7acb4748b321c724e7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNMENT AND ASSUMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A document that transfers the rights and obligations of a loan from one party to another, often used in loan syndications or assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Assignment and Assumption is a document that allows a Lender to assign its rights and obligations under the Loan Documents to another party."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitment means, as to each Lender, its commitment to make Loans to the Borrowers pursuant to Section 2.01, in an aggregate principal amount at any one time outstanding that would not result in the Revolving Credit Exposure of such Lender to exceed the US Dollar amount set forth opposite such Lender’s name on Schedule 2.01 or in the Assignment and Assumption pursuant to which such Lender becomes a party hereto, as applicable, as such amount may be adjusted from time to time in accordance with this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subject to acceptance and recording thereof by the Administrative Agent pursuant to subsection (c) of this Section, from and after the effective date specified in each Assignment and Assumption, the assignee thereunder shall be a party to this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Assignment and Assumption is a document that outlines the terms of the assignment of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Assignment and Assumption is a document that transfers the rights and obligations of a Lender to another entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"an assignment and assumption entered into by a Lender and an Eligible Assignee, and accepted by the Administrative Agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9271415b6fffe0893502dc89e3841c2be9f06f82c8c5f9489abaefaec90483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e8dd65b0bdcd2760aee8bbedd800f7746b7142b5f61618f2af7cedb31ba6ce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a7cb2d32a014cbd8ecc96746c516faa8445dc4c74435c9e1e7a4b3dcc4bbf48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1307fb50714aaa5c54a16511ecdafdda1e867cd79f4bdc3f2e60bf7361349b09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e48532ee920b5375a652dc8e8d0fdfd2761dd7785efd024ee1ed1feb0d9303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70e66841da77e158232fc791da7ba5c83a7a4e366d94c2a604edc34cc9b427fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e425af2e275bc52ded23404cc180bda000dd6a0c5f29625d84cb283b1e6497a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELEVANT GOVERNMENTAL BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A government agency or regulatory body that oversees and enforces laws related to credit agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Daily Compounded CORRA means, for any day, CORRA with interest accruing on a compounded daily basis, with the methodology and conventions for this rate being established by the Administrative Agent in accordance with the methodology and conventions for this rate selected or recommended by the Relevant Governmental Body for determining compounded CORRA for Canadian Dollar denominated business loans made in Canada;"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Relevant Governmental Body on the applicable Benchmark Replacement Date and/or (b) any evolving or then-prevailing market convention for determining a spread adjustment, or method for calculating or determining such spread adjustment, for the replacement of such Benchmark with the applicable Unadjusted Benchmark Replacement for syndicated credit facilities denominated in the applicable Agreed Currency at such time in the United States."&lt;SEP&gt;"means (a) with respect to a Benchmark Replacement in respect of Loans denominated in US Dollars, the Federal Reserve Board and/or the NYFRB or a committee officially endorsed or convened by the Federal Reserve Board and/or the NYFRB or, in each case, any successor thereto,"&lt;SEP&gt;"the Relevant Governmental Body that recommends Term CORRA for use."&lt;SEP&gt;"the authority responsible for selecting or recommending the Term CORRA interest rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16d059b04c3c34c79db1af5764af3652c9055fb5249d1bffe7a5c78ec492c07d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74c7dd64c93c0144d9f55b48b974a5e37304dd568fbae721d17ecdcf0d5c3da6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8e06f15d14c2b261e4dd5144ab3c595c16a01c4d89c05e9afcad85176811f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a9c6ebe9b09f0c3d719105cd8ced9a6a8b5cdc9b6070153b8c9d8082f94c0d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd537df50e1543242e0c0db7ea536b0f7035562c9c32eb98a80dcee483914b78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e425af2e275bc52ded23404cc180bda000dd6a0c5f29625d84cb283b1e6497a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAILY COMPOUNDED CORRA BORROWING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"a Borrowing comprised of Daily Compounded CORRA Loans"&lt;SEP&gt;"a type of borrowing that bears interest on the outstanding principal amount from the applicable borrowing or conversion date at a rate per annum equal to the Daily Compounded CORRA plus the applicable Benchmark Replacement Adjustment plus the Applicable Rate"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-064d8dd62757d82b1f21029d116981d33cf5047c69e28a4c7441d90f0d506fa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2790a1002a49b097b09cbc3582891a9773c9dc0da7cb8ba9d83655fb70f7699</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NORWAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COUNTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"a country that is a member of the EEA"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b0b12585f6502351b0e84ecc60e47e6640828e4339d67c9b7a3c5084dcdb713</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FASB ASC 105&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"the specific section of the Accounting Standards Codification that defines GAAP."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-652de4f4d91e90a6f7563949dee043c59ebc83c69af5a7e4daaf8634d33d43cd</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The SEC refers to the Securities and Exchange Commission."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Securities and Exchange Commission, or any Governmental Authority succeeding to any of its principal functions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Securities and Exchange Commission."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-523b7c35f39a59c5cfa19ecb52fd1a59b812fc7d6cb057106fe0660553c4d72c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff14b04e79a66fbfb8528158967e7f8c27d18cd00c1753f7623ec5b24aeafbe6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2e35c49fdc82fe469355cd3f4a7d66ac4e1caf86823c8a1f714e6758a00f72</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RFR BORROWING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A borrowing facility that uses a risk-free rate as its base rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"After giving effect to all borrowings of Loans, all conversions of Loans from one Type to another, and all continuations of Loans as the same Type, there shall not be more than ten Term Benchmark Borrowings and RFR Borrowings outstanding at any given time."&lt;SEP&gt;"If the Daily Simple SOFR is not the subject of a Benchmark Transition Event, such Loans shall on the last day of the then current Interest Period applicable thereto, unless prepaid, convert to, and shall constitute, an RFR Borrowing denominated in US Dollars."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-036c3af469107c12ccd7233c14b709806175fda0a66a8e3643eda71a416404ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-683730b045acd1f370fdaed2c7829337a50090b5804d74bf2b26500077b12189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a164963b51c81b4b7d5b333e9db2c3903e435b22d1b0a8d407e7203d895bb0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RISK MANAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Practices and strategies used by lenders to mitigate potential risks, including credit risk, market risk, and operational risk."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eeefb9b088abc8d89a40d93af5939ed01899b461f9a1e8dbd62765acc3ca0f5c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MITIGATION OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Mitigation Obligations refer to the borrower's obligations to mitigate any potential losses or risks associated with the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-574c6571d7017e85d1e7eca3e535c4971d4e40eee95a434accc5984191595984</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Costs or expenditures incurred by parties in relation to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Expenses refer to the costs incurred by the Lenders and the Administrative Agent in connection with the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reasonable costs and expenses incurred by the administrative agent or lenders in connection with the credit agreement, including fees, charges, and disbursements of counsel."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3d5eca3d410c6e7af1c12511c011937aecc77644104b8212bfaf1761e84d991a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc654eb29e972ffacdcbd1b1689d14682e8ad53b669e5b7b8a2de0e843401cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DESIGNATED BORROWER REQUEST AND ASSUMPTION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Designated Borrower Request and Assumption Agreement is a document that allows a Borrower to request a Loan and assume the obligations of the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"An agreement that allows a designated borrower to assume the obligations of a loan, subject to certain terms and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Designated Borrower Request and Assumption Agreement has the meaning specified in Section 2.14(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Designated Borrower Request and Assumption Agreement is an agreement between the Designated Borrower and the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"a duly executed notice and agreement in substantially the form of Exhibit E-1, which is referred to as a Designated Borrower Request and Assumption Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"before and after giving effect to such extension (A) the representations and warranties contained in Article V (and, in the case of a Designated Borrower, in its Designated Borrower Request and Assumption Agreement) are true and correct in all material respects"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3a7cb2d32a014cbd8ecc96746c516faa8445dc4c74435c9e1e7a4b3dcc4bbf48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25153dfc8542779016754e3a9d4ba1ff761fe00f9d01723cf4b526a3637e8e65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c57ca3d4b6f13c7bd1c48724f58fb0dc9179a0eb8a9db37f727f6e9c7bcca0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e48532ee920b5375a652dc8e8d0fdfd2761dd7785efd024ee1ed1feb0d9303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c65f8a967b6bdd468f8d3ea6d9afb81ef856d6ad36a5e2c1c2eaa04dd03306c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d34bfe4b8431df4ba4815a275fd36ac0a378cd81d05748dd022697a48707a14</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGREED CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of loan facility where the loan is denominated in a currency agreed upon by the parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Lender shall make the amount of its Loan available to the Administrative Agent in Same Day Funds at the Administrative Agent’s Account for the applicable Agreed Currency."&lt;SEP&gt;"If any Loan in any Agreed Currency is outstanding on the date of the Company’s receipt of notice of the commencement of a Benchmark Unavailability Period with respect to the Relevant Rate applicable to such Loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency in which a Loan is denominated."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency in which the loan is denominated and repayable."&lt;SEP&gt;"The replacement of such Benchmark with the applicable Unadjusted Benchmark Replacement for syndicated credit facilities denominated in the applicable Agreed Currency at such time in the United States."&lt;SEP&gt;"a currency agreed upon by the parties to a transaction"&lt;SEP&gt;"the currency agreed upon for a loan"&lt;SEP&gt;"the currency in which the loan is denominated"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-036c3af469107c12ccd7233c14b709806175fda0a66a8e3643eda71a416404ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc4a376d10db483b21ca8ce18794862fc9eff868acd4b16d4af5afc80bbb0b4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74c7dd64c93c0144d9f55b48b974a5e37304dd568fbae721d17ecdcf0d5c3da6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8e06f15d14c2b261e4dd5144ab3c595c16a01c4d89c05e9afcad85176811f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f736f0f97ea6ab8151aec215e65bbd3572402809b6e7b043f3c8ba68ed651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a164963b51c81b4b7d5b333e9db2c3903e435b22d1b0a8d407e7203d895bb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e46c87d01183b816db97187ef0ddad992ef24a5a3b2007491295020387a02c4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd537df50e1543242e0c0db7ea536b0f7035562c9c32eb98a80dcee483914b78</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAILY COMPOUNDED CORRA LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOAN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of Loan that bears interest at a daily compounded CORRA rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"a Loan that bears interest at a rate based on the Daily Compounded CORRA"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c610acc60b313ab2f0cb1618c5c144d079538d57f099e41f83a5a06f84e38ca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064d8dd62757d82b1f21029d116981d33cf5047c69e28a4c7441d90f0d506fa3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 4063 OF ERISA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY PROVISION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"a provision of the Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974, as amended"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b0b12585f6502351b0e84ecc60e47e6640828e4339d67c9b7a3c5084dcdb713</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A lender's legally binding promise to provide financing up to a specified amount under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any party that is contractually obligated to fulfill the terms of the agreement. While often synonymous with the borrower, this term can also include other parties with specific performance obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Such representations and warranties have been or will be relied upon by the Administrative Agent and each Lender, regardless of any investigation made by the Administrative Agent or any Lender or on their behalf and notwithstanding that the Administrative Agent or any Lender may have had notice or knowledge of any Default at the time of any Borrowing, and shall continue in full force and effect as long as any Loan or any other Obligation hereunder shall remain unpaid or unsatisfied."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Obligations of each Designated Borrower shall be guaranteed by the Company pursuant to the Guaranty contained in Article X."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Obligations refer to the commitments and obligations of the Company under this Agreement, including the repayment of the Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Obligations refer to the contractual commitments and responsibilities of the Borrower under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Obligations refer to the contractual obligations of the Company to fulfill the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Obligations refer to the financial commitments and responsibilities of the Borrowers under the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Obligations refer to the obligations of the Company and the Subsidiary under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The contractual commitments and duties that the parties to the credit agreement must fulfill."&lt;SEP&gt;"The contractual commitments and responsibilities of the borrowers and lenders under the credit agreement, including repayment of the loan, payment of interest, and compliance with covenants."&lt;SEP&gt;"The contractual obligations of the Borrowers under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lender's legally binding promise to provide financing up to a specified amount under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligations of the Company hereunder are those of primary obligor, and not merely as surety, and are independent of the Guarantee Obligations and the obligations of any other guarantor."&lt;SEP&gt;"The promises or agreements made by the Borrower to the Lender or Administrative Agent, including the repayment of the loan and compliance with covenants."&lt;SEP&gt;"all of the Obligations and any other amounts payable under this Guaranty have been paid and performed in full."&lt;SEP&gt;"the obligations of the Designated Borrowers that are guaranteed by the Company."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b285e03d7146f17e87848eb9b5f8c15183dec4084105eaa7e79c1ad84c91367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a05f2d3762035b6920e2994449915a10f14de2b16d9908fab1975c1279ab5fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ca8d6a181a8bde7e3dabd1b9b58a0f7ae55346ce1eece1febe781b49afbd657&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ff8bbfb0e9e2a8305cb863cbeecde68558028aed4c696e7b848831bc7f03992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26b5126e4c1e707b1bbe422f1a41e0d0cc8063a093ce84f380bccb1d3545594&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56521f0d5861a7f4d9b333237148742c844e3d8c2104929a676973533b40aca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c65f8a967b6bdd468f8d3ea6d9afb81ef856d6ad36a5e2c1c2eaa04dd03306c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc8c23279d4b40492da900adf3d7ce05f507b7160f15801f9294d5e8cdc3d00c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc654eb29e972ffacdcbd1b1689d14682e8ad53b669e5b7b8a2de0e843401cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d83e1d187f97b9d479a02987af469379777e335a03f2f4a566b855662bde5347&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e46c87d01183b816db97187ef0ddad992ef24a5a3b2007491295020387a02c4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-652de4f4d91e90a6f7563949dee043c59ebc83c69af5a7e4daaf8634d33d43cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5eca3d410c6e7af1c12511c011937aecc77644104b8212bfaf1761e84d991a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-279401c1a592881eefdbd927f41151f279903f6314ebe85d3fb4bab5d68a081e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e06203a764e8d9f36c5cbaca7bc8741843d94e91ddf0b7cc99ff68067bbc1a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aced5e6c50ac288864430fbe72ab45e09b7a3926dd8018932cd2f67b078cb7d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd758a235fa3762ad9b4aad4608ccd04d2283533e76b28c157982eac1454264</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 11.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A section of the Agreement that outlines the requirements for approving certain actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 11.01 is a provision in the credit agreement that outlines the procedures for amending or waiving certain terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific promises or restrictions included in the agreement that govern the borrower's operations and financial behavior."&lt;SEP&gt;"Such Defaulting Lender’s right to approve or disapprove any amendment, waiver or consent with respect to this Agreement or any other Loan Document shall be restricted as set forth in the definition of “Required Lenders” and Section 11.01."</data>
