<node id="&quot;DESIGNATED BORROWER NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Designated Borrower Notice is a document that provides notice to the Administrative Agent of a Borrower's request for a Loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal notice provided by the designated borrower to the lender, often used to request a loan disbursement or to notify the lender of a change in circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Designated Borrower Notice has the meaning specified in Section 2.14(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Administrative Agent shall send a notice in substantially the form of Exhibit E-2, which is referred to as a Designated Borrower Notice."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5d34bfe4b8431df4ba4815a275fd36ac0a378cd81d05748dd022697a48707a14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a7cb2d32a014cbd8ecc96746c516faa8445dc4c74435c9e1e7a4b3dcc4bbf48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e48532ee920b5375a652dc8e8d0fdfd2761dd7785efd024ee1ed1feb0d9303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c65f8a967b6bdd468f8d3ea6d9afb81ef856d6ad36a5e2c1c2eaa04dd03306c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of loan facility where the borrower receives funds from the lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowing is the receipt of funds or credit by the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans of the same Type, in the same Agreed Currency and to the same Borrower made, converted or continued on the same day"&lt;SEP&gt;"Such representations and warranties have been or will be relied upon by the Administrative Agent and each Lender, regardless of any investigation made by the Administrative Agent or any Lender or on their behalf and notwithstanding that the Administrative Agent or any Lender may have had notice or knowledge of any Default at the time of any Borrowing, and shall continue in full force and effect as long as any Loan or any other Obligation hereunder shall remain unpaid or unsatisfied."&lt;SEP&gt;"The act of borrowing funds by the Company under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The act of borrowing money from a lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"a SONIA Borrowing, a SARON Borrowing or, if applicable pursuant to Section 3.03, a Daily Simple SOFR Borrowing or a Daily Compounded CORRA Borrowing"&lt;SEP&gt;"a borrowing made under the credit agreement"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3dff3b153ec45df711dfc884145e6bd8e5c94c750ec4b6a3dfc30192713432e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a05f2d3762035b6920e2994449915a10f14de2b16d9908fab1975c1279ab5fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74c7dd64c93c0144d9f55b48b974a5e37304dd568fbae721d17ecdcf0d5c3da6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f235e3aaffeb5cbfa776ab6ea080fa76cc39f67d3014cd035759653e27770f28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064d8dd62757d82b1f21029d116981d33cf5047c69e28a4c7441d90f0d506fa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f736f0f97ea6ab8151aec215e65bbd3572402809b6e7b043f3c8ba68ed651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff14b04e79a66fbfb8528158967e7f8c27d18cd00c1753f7623ec5b24aeafbe6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAILY SIMPLE SARON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference interest rate used as a starting point for calculating the loan's interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Daily Simple SARON, with respect to any Loan or Borrowing denominated in Swiss Francs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The cost of borrowing expressed as a percentage of the principal, which may be fixed or variable, reflecting market conditions and the borrower's credit risk, in this case, the Daily Simple SARON."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate used to calculate the interest on a SARON Loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"an interest rate per annum equal to the greater of SARON for the day that is five RFR Business Days prior to the SARON Interest Day"&lt;SEP&gt;"each RFR Loan made by it at the Daily Simple SOFR, the Daily Simple SONIA or the Daily Simple SARON, as applicable"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cc3aeda4c8edfd097445eb549ccb4a90e255e5a840b3e4e803abe3a81e80fda1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064d8dd62757d82b1f21029d116981d33cf5047c69e28a4c7441d90f0d506fa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-683730b045acd1f370fdaed2c7829337a50090b5804d74bf2b26500077b12189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f736f0f97ea6ab8151aec215e65bbd3572402809b6e7b043f3c8ba68ed651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057f1dfd340055780e8531fd368d9afb8a7c5c552bfd91fcbb9d77cfe6ad88db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff14b04e79a66fbfb8528158967e7f8c27d18cd00c1753f7623ec5b24aeafbe6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
