<node id="&quot;ARTICLE X&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Article X refers to the section of this Agreement outlining the covenants and obligations of the Company, including its obligations to repay the Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Obligations of each Designated Borrower shall be guaranteed by the Company pursuant to the Guaranty contained in Article X."&lt;SEP&gt;"the article under which the Guaranty is made."</data>
