<node id="&quot;U.S. GOVERNMENT SECURITIES BUSINESS DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BUSINESS DAY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A day except for a Saturday, Sunday, or a day on which the Securities Industry and Financial Markets Association recommends that the fixed income departments of its members be closed."&lt;SEP&gt;"A day on which U.S. government securities are traded."&lt;SEP&gt;"The U.S. Government Securities Business Day is the day on which the U.S. Government Securities are traded."&lt;SEP&gt;"a U.S. Government Securities Business Day"&lt;SEP&gt;"a day on which US government securities are traded"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3dff3b153ec45df711dfc884145e6bd8e5c94c750ec4b6a3dfc30192713432e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74c7dd64c93c0144d9f55b48b974a5e37304dd568fbae721d17ecdcf0d5c3da6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c610acc60b313ab2f0cb1618c5c144d079538d57f099e41f83a5a06f84e38ca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8e06f15d14c2b261e4dd5144ab3c595c16a01c4d89c05e9afcad85176811f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944</data>
