</node>
<node id="&quot;DAILY SIMPLE SOFR BORROWING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of loan that bears interest on the outstanding principal amount from the applicable borrowing or conversion date at a rate per annum equal to the Daily Simple SOFR plus the Applicable Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"any Borrowing comprised of Daily Simple SOFR Loans"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-064d8dd62757d82b1f21029d116981d33cf5047c69e28a4c7441d90f0d506fa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057f1dfd340055780e8531fd368d9afb8a7c5c552bfd91fcbb9d77cfe6ad88db</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
