<node id="&quot;TERM SOFR REFERENCE RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Term SOFR Reference Rate, with respect to any Term Benchmark Loan or Term Benchmark Borrowing denominated in US Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate used as a reference for the Term SOFR."&lt;SEP&gt;"for any day and time, with respect to any Term Benchmark Borrowing denominated in US Dollars and for any tenor comparable to the applicable Interest Period, the rate per annum published by the CME Term SOFR Administrator as the forward-looking term rate based on SOFR."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-74c7dd64c93c0144d9f55b48b974a5e37304dd568fbae721d17ecdcf0d5c3da6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-683730b045acd1f370fdaed2c7829337a50090b5804d74bf2b26500077b12189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16d059b04c3c34c79db1af5764af3652c9055fb5249d1bffe7a5c78ec492c07d</data>
