<node id="&quot;DAILY SIMPLE SONIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference interest rate used as a starting point for calculating the loan's interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Daily Simple SONIA, with respect to any Loan or Borrowing denominated in Sterling."&lt;SEP&gt;"The cost of borrowing expressed as a percentage of the principal, which may be fixed or variable, reflecting market conditions and the borrower's credit risk, in this case, the Daily Simple SONIA."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate used to calculate the interest on a SONIA Loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"an interest rate per annum equal to the greater of SONIA for the day that is five RFR Business Days prior to the SONIA Interest Day"&lt;SEP&gt;"each RFR Loan made by it at the Daily Simple SOFR, the Daily Simple SONIA or the Daily Simple SARON, as applicable"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cc3aeda4c8edfd097445eb549ccb4a90e255e5a840b3e4e803abe3a81e80fda1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064d8dd62757d82b1f21029d116981d33cf5047c69e28a4c7441d90f0d506fa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-683730b045acd1f370fdaed2c7829337a50090b5804d74bf2b26500077b12189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f736f0f97ea6ab8151aec215e65bbd3572402809b6e7b043f3c8ba68ed651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057f1dfd340055780e8531fd368d9afb8a7c5c552bfd91fcbb9d77cfe6ad88db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff14b04e79a66fbfb8528158967e7f8c27d18cd00c1753f7623ec5b24aeafbe6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
