<node id="&quot;FLOOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Benchmark Replacement as determined pursuant to clause (1), (2) or (3) above would be less than the Floor, the Benchmark Replacement will be deemed to be the Floor for the purposes of this Agreement and the other Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"the benchmark rate floor, if any, provided in this Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f8e06f15d14c2b261e4dd5144ab3c595c16a01c4d89c05e9afcad85176811f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14e8e3cfeec76b5832426da03fd19e479d7aaf6c8a4f22b76860a34f613b7219</data>
