<node id="&quot;DEFAULT RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Default Rate is the interest rate applicable to the Loans in the event of a default by the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"an interest rate equal to the Base Rate plus the Applicable Rate applicable to Base Rate Loans plus 2% per annum"&lt;SEP&gt;"the rate at which overdue amounts bear interest, equal to the Default Rate to the fullest extent permitted by applicable Laws"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-279401c1a592881eefdbd927f41151f279903f6314ebe85d3fb4bab5d68a081e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064d8dd62757d82b1f21029d116981d33cf5047c69e28a4c7441d90f0d506fa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2790a1002a49b097b09cbc3582891a9773c9dc0da7cb8ba9d83655fb70f7699</data>
