<node id="&quot;ARRANGER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An entity that arranges the credit agreement, responsible for coordinating the loan and ensuring that all parties are in compliance with the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that organizes and structures the credit agreement, often responsible for negotiating terms and conditions with the borrower and lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent and the Arranger hereby informs the Lenders that each such Person is not undertaking to provide impartial investment advice, or to give advice in a fiduciary capacity, in connection with the transactions contemplated hereby."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Arranger is a lender that provides financing to the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Arranger is an entity that assists in the arrangement of the loan and is not a party to the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"the entity responsible for arranging the credit agreement and facilitating the transaction between the borrowers and lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1c57ca3d4b6f13c7bd1c48724f58fb0dc9179a0eb8a9db37f727f6e9c7bcca0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a3d2b24cfcf893da9826354352f4a7639afec65277f7fddb2b7adfc118840d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70e66841da77e158232fc791da7ba5c83a7a4e366d94c2a604edc34cc9b427fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d83e1d187f97b9d479a02987af469379777e335a03f2f4a566b855662bde5347&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4126b4b4c0ad66505c7d9dd64d6916e9aae5e634b3890281c7177c2b0e53a84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2facca2c062c9b7ce891849070758dd3706fef511167f7acb4748b321c724e7d</data>
