<node id="&quot;SUBSIDIARIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal business entity or corporation that engages in commercial, industrial, or professional activities, often a subsidiary of the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any subsidiaries of the company that are party to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Companies that are owned or controlled by the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"Consolidated Total Assets means, as of any date of determination, consolidated total assets of the Company and its Subsidiaries as of such date determined in accordance with GAAP."&lt;SEP&gt;"Designated Borrowers, subsidiaries of AMAZON.COM, INC."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subsidiaries are entities that are owned or controlled by the borrower or the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company and its Subsidiaries or to the determination of any amount for the Company and its Subsidiaries on a consolidated basis"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subsidiaries are companies that are owned or controlled by the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subsidiaries are obligors in the credit agreement, and the agreement outlines various types of liens and encumbrances that may affect their property or assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subsidiaries are the companies that are owned or controlled by the Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The assignee of such interest shall be deemed to be a Defaulting Lender for all purposes of this Agreement until such compliance occurs, and shall not be a Subsidiary of the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"the subsidiaries of the Company"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9271415b6fffe0893502dc89e3841c2be9f06f82c8c5f9489abaefaec90483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c8ccb9ae0ce6b50448d0662187cdebe651dfc72a75e420e155916a8d69201a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1307fb50714aaa5c54a16511ecdafdda1e867cd79f4bdc3f2e60bf7361349b09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea39c0b69f2565d1a546acadfc03816ec6661a5d2c4c74b76c580f297a644dc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e48532ee920b5375a652dc8e8d0fdfd2761dd7785efd024ee1ed1feb0d9303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-523b7c35f39a59c5cfa19ecb52fd1a59b812fc7d6cb057106fe0660553c4d72c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffa333ba0635dfede67f8ea5e9914c4783139c8fc1ab497336bf6f481fabdc91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-243cf92c11d25bde5e4778831027cd7c49ba52026095b54d99e7210645194a56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a34ec7ffc5432911519463a4d806edde9566d8d3383aef9f37db8ac12227f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26e39a9e3ce38e35ba80037cbf39058662ce1dbd88dd87d6a9a695b35bb692f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3635abde8c7e5a6f484e19948315859a2e2ed6f744a89175ad7f5758f30b40f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e425af2e275bc52ded23404cc180bda000dd6a0c5f29625d84cb283b1e6497a6</data>
