  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Benchmark Replacement Conforming Changes are the changes made to the Loan Documents to conform to the Benchmark Replacement."&lt;SEP&gt;"changes made to the credit agreement to conform to a new benchmark replacement"</data>
