<node id="&quot;EVENT OF DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific event that constitutes a Default, such as non-payment, breach of covenants, or failure to comply with regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Event of Default occurs when the Company or any other Borrower fails to comply with the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Event of Default occurs when the borrower fails to meet their obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Event of Default refers to a specific event that triggers certain consequences under the credit agreement, such as the acceleration of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"During the existence of an Event of Default, upon the request of the Required Lenders, (i) no Loans denominated in US Dollars shall be converted to or continued as Term Benchmark Loans without the consent of the Required Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"If any Event of Default occurs and is continuing, the Administrative Agent shall, at the request of, or may, with the consent of, the Required Lenders, take any or all of the following actions"&lt;SEP&gt;"an event that triggers a Default"&lt;SEP&gt;"has the meaning specified in Section 8.01."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ec7874b9697abfa7fdec5c3eba7cff86c0d83eb6bd59405831eed85588e963df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f9271415b6fffe0893502dc89e3841c2be9f06f82c8c5f9489abaefaec90483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064d8dd62757d82b1f21029d116981d33cf5047c69e28a4c7441d90f0d506fa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a164963b51c81b4b7d5b333e9db2c3903e435b22d1b0a8d407e7203d895bb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e46c87d01183b816db97187ef0ddad992ef24a5a3b2007491295020387a02c4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a31d91e19f5e79dee072438030f29981db72d5f3569150ff42952e39d103036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e06203a764e8d9f36c5cbaca7bc8741843d94e91ddf0b7cc99ff68067bbc1a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09e9c5e5b8a7a8f4ad5eb675c75b46dfea2876894f750bdb96a586997b962e8c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXCHANGE RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Administrative Agent shall determine the US Dollar Equivalent of any Loan denominated in an Alternative Currency using the Exchange Rate for such Alternative Currency in relation to US Dollars"&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate at which one currency can be exchanged for another."&lt;SEP&gt;"the rate at which an Alternative Currency may be exchanged into US Dollars."</data>
