</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal, legally binding contract outlining the rights, obligations, and terms between two or more parties, in this case, the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal, legally binding contract outlining the rights, obligations, and terms between two or more parties. In a credit context, it details the financing arrangement, including terms of borrowing, repayment schedules, interest rates, and collateral."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Benchmark Replacement will be deemed to be the Floor for the purposes of this Agreement and the other Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company or any Borrower’s compliance with the terms of the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Documents are the contractual agreements between the Company and the Lenders, including the credit agreement and other related documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Documents are the formal agreements outlining the terms and conditions of the Loans, including this Agreement and other related documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Documents are the formal agreements outlining the terms and conditions of the loan, including the rights and obligations of the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Documents include this Agreement, each Note, each Designated Borrower Request and Assumption Agreement, each Designated Borrower Notice and the Fee Letter."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Documents, including this Agreement, prepared, negotiated, executed and delivered in connection with the credit facility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The documents outlining the terms and conditions of the loan, including the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The formal, legally binding contract outlining the rights, obligations, and terms between two or more parties, including the financing arrangement, interest rates, and collateral."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest paid or agreed to be paid under the Loan Documents shall not exceed the maximum rate of non-usurious interest permitted by applicable Law."&lt;SEP&gt;"This Agreement and the other Loan Documents and any claims, controversy, dispute or cause of action (whether in contract or tort or otherwise and whether at law or in equity) based upon, arising out of or relating to this Agreement or any other Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"electronic images of this Agreement or any other Loan Documents (in each case, including with respect to any signature pages thereto) shall have the same legal effect, validity and enforceability as any paper original."&lt;SEP&gt;"may receive fees or other payments in connection with the transactions contemplated hereby, the other Loan Documents or otherwise."&lt;SEP&gt;"the collective documents outlining the terms and conditions of the credit facility"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fc71017c2caaab37d172ceaf0e09b388e1dce067cbd68e8f1e99012d931b5fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a05f2d3762035b6920e2994449915a10f14de2b16d9908fab1975c1279ab5fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a3d2b24cfcf893da9826354352f4a7639afec65277f7fddb2b7adfc118840d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22018e046e6afa039b6c5519ad4d3d2a187b5ee53945844568160c46abb9f6a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e48532ee920b5375a652dc8e8d0fdfd2761dd7785efd024ee1ed1feb0d9303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70e66841da77e158232fc791da7ba5c83a7a4e366d94c2a604edc34cc9b427fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d83e1d187f97b9d479a02987af469379777e335a03f2f4a566b855662bde5347&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8e06f15d14c2b261e4dd5144ab3c595c16a01c4d89c05e9afcad85176811f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9642d5dbe46eea76db5bf5d1ab9b32111e99d996ae540a37b6c308a64367cbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc654eb29e972ffacdcbd1b1689d14682e8ad53b669e5b7b8a2de0e843401cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cf30aa371483ffc5e424225ef332db8adf37eeb6519c28e0905154c67a5e75e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-279401c1a592881eefdbd927f41151f279903f6314ebe85d3fb4bab5d68a081e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-243cf92c11d25bde5e4778831027cd7c49ba52026095b54d99e7210645194a56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a34ec7ffc5432911519463a4d806edde9566d8d3383aef9f37db8ac12227f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33cb52d5337eb942b4ed3da0d48ee32399c0e0869d20193c317a8a2c3a06049&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd758a235fa3762ad9b4aad4608ccd04d2283533e76b28c157982eac1454264</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RFR BUSINESS DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BUSINESS DAY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"(a) for any Loan denominated in US Dollars, a U.S. Government Securities Business Day, (b) for any Loan denominated in Sterling, any day except for (i) a Saturday, (ii) a Sunday or (iii) a day on which banks are closed for general business in London"&lt;SEP&gt;"The RFR Business Day is the day on which the RFR (Risk-Free Rate) is determined."&lt;SEP&gt;"a day on which risk-free rate loans are traded"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3dff3b153ec45df711dfc884145e6bd8e5c94c750ec4b6a3dfc30192713432e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8e06f15d14c2b261e4dd5144ab3c595c16a01c4d89c05e9afcad85176811f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
