<node id="&quot;EXCLUDED TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Taxes imposed on or with respect to any Recipient or required to be withheld or deducted from a payment to a Recipient."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes that are excluded from indemnification by the borrowers or lenders, including taxes attributable to the gross negligence or willful misconduct of any of the recipients or their affiliates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes, other than Excluded Taxes, imposed on or with respect to any payment made by or on account of any obligation of any Borrower under any Loan Document"&lt;SEP&gt;"The taxes that are excluded from the credit agreement, including taxes that are withheld by the lender on behalf of the governmental authority."&lt;SEP&gt;"any Taxes that are excluded from the definition of Other Taxes"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ec7874b9697abfa7fdec5c3eba7cff86c0d83eb6bd59405831eed85588e963df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be25a46cca3a79843b2c8a4c855abca0c524be4f23bd13985d7ed013c2da3408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4c601fe8f9d4d8b25c08bf113b5bf96ae2574679bd1e9086048018d2759a602&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b382365636e7d7745a443218cd6b4521b203ff098b36b45bf2b0ac9d851d876&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5eca3d410c6e7af1c12511c011937aecc77644104b8212bfaf1761e84d991a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LIEN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A lien is a type of collateral that can be used to secure indebtedness, and the agreement outlines various types of liens that may be permitted."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any mortgage, pledge, hypothecation, collateral assignment, deposit arrangement, encumbrance, lien, charge, or other security interest or preferential arrangement in the nature of a security interest of any kind or nature whatsoever."&lt;SEP&gt;"a Lien on property owned or being purchased by such Person"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4c601fe8f9d4d8b25c08bf113b5bf96ae2574679bd1e9086048018d2759a602&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea39c0b69f2565d1a546acadfc03816ec6661a5d2c4c74b76c580f297a644dc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e48532ee920b5375a652dc8e8d0fdfd2761dd7785efd024ee1ed1feb0d9303</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OVERNIGHT RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference interest rate used as a starting point for calculating the loan's interest rate. A margin is typically added to this base rate to determine the final rate charged."&lt;SEP&gt;"An overnight rate determined by the Administrative Agent in accordance with banking industry rules on interbank compensation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Overnight Rate is the interest rate used as a reference point for calculating the interest rate on the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Overnight Rate is used to calculate interest on payments made by the Lender or Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f6e8743e0fed11cf1e7302388e7b8f38f70918d5b087d464be884bffcad84ea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50c8db37c43d3f2580ae0f2d2a37e258761568ad254938243b61070df4eb971e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2141173015c46be9ca6585c8d90f54859a18bceb2a1115b6a05be09cc1f8ba2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26b5126e4c1e707b1bbe422f1a41e0d0cc8063a093ce84f380bccb1d3545594</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SARON LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
