<node id="&quot;AUD BANK BILL RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference interest rate used as a starting point for calculating the loan's interest rate, in this case, the AUD Bank Bill Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference interest rate used as a starting point for calculating the loan's interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The AUD Bank Bill Rate, with respect to any Loan or Borrowing denominated in Australian Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"a reference interest rate used to calculate the interest rate for ABBR Loans"&lt;SEP&gt;"each Lender shall be deemed to have funded each Term Benchmark Loan made by it at the Term SOFR, the EURIBO Rate, the TIBO Rate, the CDO Rate or the AUD Bank Bill Rate for such Loan, as applicable"&lt;SEP&gt;"the Australian Dollar Bank Bill Rate, a benchmark interest rate"&lt;SEP&gt;"the average bid reference rate administered by ASX Benchmark Pty Limited for bills of exchange in Australian Dollars"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cc3aeda4c8edfd097445eb549ccb4a90e255e5a840b3e4e803abe3a81e80fda1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c8ccb9ae0ce6b50448d0662187cdebe651dfc72a75e420e155916a8d69201a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-683730b045acd1f370fdaed2c7829337a50090b5804d74bf2b26500077b12189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f736f0f97ea6ab8151aec215e65bbd3572402809b6e7b043f3c8ba68ed651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-243cf92c11d25bde5e4778831027cd7c49ba52026095b54d99e7210645194a56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057f1dfd340055780e8531fd368d9afb8a7c5c552bfd91fcbb9d77cfe6ad88db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944</data>
