<node id="&quot;AGGREGATE COMMITMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A lenders legally binding promise to provide financing up to a specified amount under certain conditions. This term signifies the obligation of the lender to make funds available when required."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Aggregate Commitments shall automatically terminate at 5:00 p.m., New York City time, on the Maturity Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of credit committed by the Lenders to the Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Aggregate Commitments and US$5,000,000,000."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Total Outstandings shall not exceed the Aggregate Commitments,"&lt;SEP&gt;"the total Commitments of all Lenders, equal to US$15,000,000,000 as of the Closing Date"&lt;SEP&gt;"the total amount of commitments made by the lenders under the credit agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"the total amount of commitments made by the lenders"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0e8dd65b0bdcd2760aee8bbedd800f7746b7142b5f61618f2af7cedb31ba6ce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c8ccb9ae0ce6b50448d0662187cdebe651dfc72a75e420e155916a8d69201a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d83e1d187f97b9d479a02987af469379777e335a03f2f4a566b855662bde5347&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b366223ffce1d243cf104dd968c58e4e03ce0ef2716ea0865cb3ed376a6e0bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21e8bd401eb8d2893cda3131348d5d8ecee9345959902e114ca131d8e2d1d670&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2790a1002a49b097b09cbc3582891a9773c9dc0da7cb8ba9d83655fb70f7699&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-243cf92c11d25bde5e4778831027cd7c49ba52026095b54d99e7210645194a56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd758a235fa3762ad9b4aad4608ccd04d2283533e76b28c157982eac1454264</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADMINISTRATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A person or entity responsible for managing and administering the assets of a company or individual."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrator is the entity responsible for administering the Benchmark."&lt;SEP&gt;"the financial institution or entity that provides the loan to the borrower"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5d34bfe4b8431df4ba4815a275fd36ac0a378cd81d05748dd022697a48707a14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8e06f15d14c2b261e4dd5144ab3c595c16a01c4d89c05e9afcad85176811f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc4a376d10db483b21ca8ce18794862fc9eff868acd4b16d4af5afc80bbb0b4d</data>
