<node id="&quot;SAME DAY FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Each Lender shall make the amount of its Loan available to the Administrative Agent in Same Day Funds at the Administrative Agent’s Account for the applicable Agreed Currency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Same Day Funds are used for payments made by the Lender or Borrower to the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The structured credit or loan arrangement outlined in the agreement, which defines the specific financing structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The structured credit or loan arrangement outlined in the agreement. This term covers various forms of credit, such as revolving credit or term loans, and defines the specific financing structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"immediately available funds, and (b) with respect to disbursements and payments in an Alternative Currency, same day or other funds as may be reasonably determined by the Administrative Agent"</data>
