<node id="&quot;CLOSING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Closing Date is the date on which the Loan Documents are executed and the loan is closed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Closing Date is the date on which the credit agreement is effective."&lt;SEP&gt;"The closing date is the date on which the loan is disbursed to the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which the credit agreement is closed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which the credit agreement is executed and becomes effective, marking the commencement of the loan term."&lt;SEP&gt;"The first date all the conditions precedent in Section 4.01 are satisfied or waived in accordance with Section 11.01."&lt;SEP&gt;"the anniversary of the Closing Date immediately following the delivery of the notice from the Company requesting such extension,"&lt;SEP&gt;"the date on which the credit agreement is closed"&lt;SEP&gt;"the date on which the credit agreement is executed"&lt;SEP&gt;"the date on which the credit agreement is executed, marking the commencement of the agreement"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-be25a46cca3a79843b2c8a4c855abca0c524be4f23bd13985d7ed013c2da3408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c57ca3d4b6f13c7bd1c48724f58fb0dc9179a0eb8a9db37f727f6e9c7bcca0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c8ccb9ae0ce6b50448d0662187cdebe651dfc72a75e420e155916a8d69201a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25153dfc8542779016754e3a9d4ba1ff761fe00f9d01723cf4b526a3637e8e65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70e66841da77e158232fc791da7ba5c83a7a4e366d94c2a604edc34cc9b427fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d284a32dc973551dd3a95e067c7a7e4ca65ed5fc4b8b9af49298c1a4ab4c8738&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2790a1002a49b097b09cbc3582891a9773c9dc0da7cb8ba9d83655fb70f7699&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffa333ba0635dfede67f8ea5e9914c4783139c8fc1ab497336bf6f481fabdc91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-243cf92c11d25bde5e4778831027cd7c49ba52026095b54d99e7210645194a56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd758a235fa3762ad9b4aad4608ccd04d2283533e76b28c157982eac1454264</data>
