</node>
<node id="&quot;DESIGNATED JURISDICTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Designated Jurisdiction is a country or region that is subject to certain restrictions or sanctions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A jurisdiction that is subject to Sanctions or other restrictions imposed by governments or international organizations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any country or territory to the extent that such country or territory itself is the subject of any Sanction."</data>
