</node>
<node id="&quot;FATCA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A regulatory term referring to the Foreign Account Tax Compliance Act, which is part of applicable law mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"FATCA is a regulatory requirement that imposes withholding tax on certain payments made to foreign entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sections 1471 through 1474 of the Code, as of the date of this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Foreign Account Tax Compliance Act, which imposes Taxes on certain payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ec7874b9697abfa7fdec5c3eba7cff86c0d83eb6bd59405831eed85588e963df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5df97a15cda855416ef6ff0ebbf7aa9f54e1229c4f8fa6db6f23ed463e738ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14e8e3cfeec76b5832426da03fd19e479d7aaf6c8a4f22b76860a34f613b7219&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b285e03d7146f17e87848eb9b5f8c15183dec4084105eaa7e79c1ad84c91367</data>
