<node id="&quot;PATRIOT ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A regulation that has the meaning specified in Section 11.18."&lt;SEP&gt;"The USA PATRIOT Act (Title III of Pub. L. 107-56 (signed into law October 26, 2001)) (the “Patriot Act”) and/or Beneficial Ownership Regulation."&lt;SEP&gt;"regulatory authorities under applicable “Know Your Customer” and anti-money laundering rules and regulations, including the PATRIOT Act."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f6e8743e0fed11cf1e7302388e7b8f38f70918d5b087d464be884bffcad84ea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33cb52d5337eb942b4ed3da0d48ee32399c0e0869d20193c317a8a2c3a06049&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c65f8a967b6bdd468f8d3ea6d9afb81ef856d6ad36a5e2c1c2eaa04dd03306c</data>
