<node id="&quot;CITY OF NEW YORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Administrative Agent, acting solely for this purpose as a non-fiduciary agent of the Borrowers, shall maintain at one of its offices in the City of New York a copy of each Assignment and Assumption delivered to it."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1307fb50714aaa5c54a16511ecdafdda1e867cd79f4bdc3f2e60bf7361349b09</data>
