</node>
<node id="&quot;DESIGNATED BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Subsidiary that is designated as a borrower under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A designated borrower is a foreign subsidiary that is a party to the agreement and has designated the company as its process agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific borrower designated in the credit agreement, responsible for repayment of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific borrower designated under the credit agreement, subject to certain conditions and requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"If any payment by or on behalf of any Designated Borrower or the Company is made, or any of the Credit Parties exercises its right of setoff, in respect of the Obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company may at any time, upon not less than 10 Business Days’ notice from the Company to the Administrative Agent, designate any additional Subsidiary of the Company as a Designated Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Designated Borrower has the meaning specified in the preamble hereto."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Designated Borrower is a borrower that is designated to receive loans under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"a Subsidiary of AMAZON.COM, INC. that is a party to the credit agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"a foreign subsidiary that has or may acquire immunity from jurisdiction, legal proceedings, attachment, execution, judgment, or setoff in any jurisdiction."&lt;SEP&gt;"before and after giving effect to such extension (A) the representations and warranties contained in Article V (and, in the case of a Designated Borrower, in its Designated Borrower Request and Assumption Agreement) are true and correct in all material respects"&lt;SEP&gt;"if applicable, the Designated Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"in the case of all other amounts, such assignment will result in a reduction in such compensation or payments thereafter, from the Company or applicable Designated Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Company shall promptly compensate (or cause the applicable Designated Borrower to promptly compensate) such Lender for and hold such Lender harmless from any loss (other than lost profit), cost or expense incurred by it"</data>
