  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A clause in the credit agreement that outlines the terms and conditions for replacing a Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific promises or restrictions included in the agreement that govern the borrower's operations and financial behavior."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company shall have the right to replace each Non-Extending Lender with one or more Eligible Assignees as provided in Section 11.13."&lt;SEP&gt;"as a result of a request by the Company pursuant to Section 11.13"&lt;SEP&gt;"the section of the agreement that specifies the requirements for assigning interests in the Loan or Commitment."</data>
