<node id="&quot;COVENANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Specific promises or restrictions included in the agreement that govern the borrower's operations and financial behavior, designed to protect the lender's interests."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific promises or restrictions included in the agreement that govern the borrower's operations and financial behavior."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific promises or restrictions included in the agreement that govern the borrowers' operations and financial behavior, designed to protect the lenders' interests by ensuring the borrower remains within defined risk parameters."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Covenants are specific promises or restrictions included in the agreement that govern the Borrower's operations and financial behavior."</data>
