<node id="&quot;DEBTOR RELIEF LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any Borrower or any Material Subsidiary institutes or consents to the institution of any proceeding under any Debtor Relief Law"&lt;SEP&gt;"Any law that provides relief to debtors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Debtor Relief Law refers to the authorities or bodies responsible for overseeing and enforcing compliance with laws, rules, and regulations that govern credit agreements and financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Debtor Relief Law refers to the laws and regulations that govern debt relief and bankruptcy proceedings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the authorities or bodies responsible for overseeing and enforcing compliance with laws, rules, and regulations that govern credit agreements and financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent shall not be required to take any action that, in its opinion or the opinion of its counsel, may expose the Administrative Agent to liability or that is contrary to any Loan Document or applicable Law, including for the avoidance of doubt any action that may be in violation of the automatic stay under any Debtor Relief Law."&lt;SEP&gt;"laws that provide relief to debtors"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a26b5126e4c1e707b1bbe422f1a41e0d0cc8063a093ce84f380bccb1d3545594&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d83e1d187f97b9d479a02987af469379777e335a03f2f4a566b855662bde5347&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-405e30a8247fa3f574e4cf704c4da2490c7b07557815fff2ebf7de66149d000a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2790a1002a49b097b09cbc3582891a9773c9dc0da7cb8ba9d83655fb70f7699&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d34bfe4b8431df4ba4815a275fd36ac0a378cd81d05748dd022697a48707a14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39903c506f2ed6e3becee13eaa6df530fdd376a6533c5d81ffd839e61ab1166c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09e9c5e5b8a7a8f4ad5eb675c75b46dfea2876894f750bdb96a586997b962e8c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A lender's legally binding promise to provide financing up to a specified amount under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any reduction of the Aggregate Commitments shall be applied to the Commitment of each Lender according to its Applicable Percentage."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitment is the amount of money that the Lender has agreed to lend to the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitment of each Non-Extending Lender shall terminate on the Existing Maturity Date,"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitment refers to the Lender's promise to provide financing up to a specified amount under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitment refers to the lender's promise to provide financing under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount of credit that a Lender is committed to provide."&lt;SEP&gt;"declare the Commitment of each Lender to be terminated, whereupon the Commitments shall be terminated"&lt;SEP&gt;"the Revolving Credit Exposure of any Lender shall not exceed such Lender’s Commitment,"&lt;SEP&gt;"the commitment of the Lenders to make Loans under the Existing 3-Year Credit Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ec7874b9697abfa7fdec5c3eba7cff86c0d83eb6bd59405831eed85588e963df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f9271415b6fffe0893502dc89e3841c2be9f06f82c8c5f9489abaefaec90483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25153dfc8542779016754e3a9d4ba1ff761fe00f9d01723cf4b526a3637e8e65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26b5126e4c1e707b1bbe422f1a41e0d0cc8063a093ce84f380bccb1d3545594&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c610acc60b313ab2f0cb1618c5c144d079538d57f099e41f83a5a06f84e38ca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22018e046e6afa039b6c5519ad4d3d2a187b5ee53945844568160c46abb9f6a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-523b7c35f39a59c5cfa19ecb52fd1a59b812fc7d6cb057106fe0660553c4d72c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09e9c5e5b8a7a8f4ad5eb675c75b46dfea2876894f750bdb96a586997b962e8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b366223ffce1d243cf104dd968c58e4e03ce0ef2716ea0865cb3ed376a6e0bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21e8bd401eb8d2893cda3131348d5d8ecee9345959902e114ca131d8e2d1d670&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeefb9b088abc8d89a40d93af5939ed01899b461f9a1e8dbd62765acc3ca0f5c</data>
