<node id="&quot;RECEIVER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A lender or financial institution that holds a security interest in collateral provided by the borrower. This interest serves as assurance, allowing the lender to claim the collateral if the borrower defaults."&lt;SEP&gt;"A person appointed to manage the assets of a company or individual that is unable to pay its debts."&lt;SEP&gt;"applies for or consents to the appointment of any receiver, trustee, custodian, conservator, liquidator, rehabilitator or similar officer for it or for all or any material part of its property"</data>
