<node id="&quot;BORROWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"AMAZON.COM, INC. and its Subsidiaries, the entities borrowing under the credit facility"&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitment means, as to each Lender, its commitment to make Loans to the Borrowers pursuant to Section 2.01, in an aggregate principal amount at any one time outstanding that would not result in the Revolving Credit Exposure of such Lender to exceed the US Dollar amount set forth opposite such Lender’s name on Schedule 2.01 or in the Assignment and Assumption pursuant to which such Lender becomes a party hereto, as applicable, as such amount may be adjusted from time to time in accordance with this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Borrower shall, promptly following any reasonable request by the Administrative Agent or any Lender, provide all Regulatory Information that the Administrative Agent or such Lender requests."&lt;SEP&gt;"Individuals, companies, or entities that receive loans or credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrowers are the entities receiving the loan and are responsible for repaying the loan according to the agreed terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrowers are the entities that borrow money under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrowers are the entities that have borrowed money under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrowers shall prepay Loans in an aggregate amount sufficient to eliminate such excess."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entities that receive funds under the credit agreement and are responsible for repaying the loan according to the agreed terms, including any interest and fees."&lt;SEP&gt;"The individual, company, or legal entity that receives funds under the credit agreement and is responsible for repaying the loan according to the agreed terms, including any interest and fees."&lt;SEP&gt;"each Lender severally agrees to make loans (each such loan, a “Loan”) to the Borrowers"&lt;SEP&gt;"the entities specified in the preamble of the loan document, responsible for repaying the loan"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1c57ca3d4b6f13c7bd1c48724f58fb0dc9179a0eb8a9db37f727f6e9c7bcca0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ff8bbfb0e9e2a8305cb863cbeecde68558028aed4c696e7b848831bc7f03992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-523b7c35f39a59c5cfa19ecb52fd1a59b812fc7d6cb057106fe0660553c4d72c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc654eb29e972ffacdcbd1b1689d14682e8ad53b669e5b7b8a2de0e843401cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b366223ffce1d243cf104dd968c58e4e03ce0ef2716ea0865cb3ed376a6e0bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21e8bd401eb8d2893cda3131348d5d8ecee9345959902e114ca131d8e2d1d670&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5eca3d410c6e7af1c12511c011937aecc77644104b8212bfaf1761e84d991a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-243cf92c11d25bde5e4778831027cd7c49ba52026095b54d99e7210645194a56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33cb52d5337eb942b4ed3da0d48ee32399c0e0869d20193c317a8a2c3a06049&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e425af2e275bc52ded23404cc180bda000dd6a0c5f29625d84cb283b1e6497a6</data>
