<node id="&quot;COLLATERAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COLLATERAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Assets or property pledged as security for a loan or credit arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assets or property pledged by the borrower as security for the loan, helping reduce the lender's risk by providing a means to recover funds in case of default."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assets or property pledged by the borrower as security for the loan, which can be seized by the lender in the event of default."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assets or property pledged by the borrower as security for the loan. Collateral helps reduce the lender's risk by providing a means to recover funds in case of default."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assets or property pledged by the borrower as security for the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Collateral is the asset or property pledged by the borrower as security for the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Collateral refers to the assets or property pledged by the Borrower as security for the loan."</data>
