<node id="&quot;US DOLLARS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference interest rate used as a starting point for calculating the loan's interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan facility where the loan is denominated in US Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each borrowing of Loans, each conversion of Loans denominated in US Dollars from one Type to another and each continuation of Term Benchmark Loans shall be made upon the applicable Borrower’s irrevocable notice to the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"If the Daily Simple SOFR is not the subject of a Benchmark Transition Event, such Loans shall on the last day of the then current Interest Period applicable thereto, unless prepaid, convert to, and shall constitute, an RFR Borrowing denominated in US Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans denominated in US Dollars may be Base Rate Loans,"&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency in which certain loans and borrowings are denominated."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency in which the Overnight Bank Funding Rate is denominated."&lt;SEP&gt;"no Loans denominated in US Dollars shall be converted to or continued as Term Benchmark Loans without the consent of the Required Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"the currency in which Term SOFR Borrowing is denominated."&lt;SEP&gt;"the currency in which the credit agreement is denominated."&lt;SEP&gt;"the official currency of the United States"&lt;SEP&gt;"the primary currency of the credit facility"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0e8dd65b0bdcd2760aee8bbedd800f7746b7142b5f61618f2af7cedb31ba6ce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-036c3af469107c12ccd7233c14b709806175fda0a66a8e3643eda71a416404ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ff8bbfb0e9e2a8305cb863cbeecde68558028aed4c696e7b848831bc7f03992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16d059b04c3c34c79db1af5764af3652c9055fb5249d1bffe7a5c78ec492c07d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6e8743e0fed11cf1e7302388e7b8f38f70918d5b087d464be884bffcad84ea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-683730b045acd1f370fdaed2c7829337a50090b5804d74bf2b26500077b12189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a164963b51c81b4b7d5b333e9db2c3903e435b22d1b0a8d407e7203d895bb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f736f0f97ea6ab8151aec215e65bbd3572402809b6e7b043f3c8ba68ed651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21e8bd401eb8d2893cda3131348d5d8ecee9345959902e114ca131d8e2d1d670&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-243cf92c11d25bde5e4778831027cd7c49ba52026095b54d99e7210645194a56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f945709d114cee142af65ee864299dd933046f3d5c2c59a4f7e3b675e775a0db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd537df50e1543242e0c0db7ea536b0f7035562c9c32eb98a80dcee483914b78</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
