<node id="&quot;TRUSTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SECURITY TRUSTEE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A person or entity responsible for managing and administering a trust or estate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trustee is the entity responsible for holding and managing the collateral on behalf of the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"applies for or consents to the appointment of any receiver, trustee, custodian, conservator, liquidator, rehabilitator or similar officer for it or for all or any material part of its property"&lt;SEP&gt;"such amounts shall be held in trust for the benefit of the Credit Parties."</data>
