<node id="&quot;SECURITY INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LIEN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal right or claim against a borrower's asset, granted to the lender as security for the loan, ensuring the lender can recover its funds by seizing and selling the asset if necessary."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal right or claim against a borrower's asset, granted to the lender as security for the loan. A lien ensures that the lender can recover its funds by seizing and selling the asset if necessary."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal right or claim against a borrower's asset, granted to the lender as security for the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender's right to claim collateral in the event of default."&lt;SEP&gt;"A security interest is a lien or claim against the collateral provided by the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"the receipt or perfection of a security interest under any Loan Document"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-287e1de5e659a7178eed8c39f284e89d7d984ce914fef63cc2925dcee357efee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d83e1d187f97b9d479a02987af469379777e335a03f2f4a566b855662bde5347&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f235e3aaffeb5cbfa776ab6ea080fa76cc39f67d3014cd035759653e27770f28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b382365636e7d7745a443218cd6b4521b203ff098b36b45bf2b0ac9d851d876&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56521f0d5861a7f4d9b333237148742c844e3d8c2104929a676973533b40aca</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ALTERNATIVE CURRENCIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Outstanding Amount of all Loans denominated in Alternative Currencies at such time exceeds an amount equal to 105% of the Alternative Currency Sublimit then in effect."&lt;SEP&gt;"currencies other than US Dollars in which the credit facility is denominated"&lt;SEP&gt;"four Business Days prior to the requested date of any borrowing or continuation of Term Benchmark Loans denominated in other Alternative Currencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"the currencies in which the loan can be denominated"</data>
