<node id="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE QUESTIONNAIRE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Administrative Questionnaire is a document that must be delivered to the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The administrative questionnaire is a document used to gather information about a lender's administrative procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"a document provided by the Administrative Agent to the Lenders"</data>
