<node id="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A company that is owned or controlled by another company, in this case, the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"A company that is owned or controlled by another company."&lt;SEP&gt;"A corporation, partnership, joint venture, limited liability company or other business entity of which a majority of the shares of securities or other interests having ordinary voting power for the election of directors or other governing body are at the time beneficially owned, or the management of which is otherwise controlled, directly, or indirectly through one or more intermediaries, or both, by such Person."&lt;SEP&gt;"A subsidiary is a company that is owned or controlled by another company."&lt;SEP&gt;"A subsidiary is a company that is owned or controlled by the company."&lt;SEP&gt;"A wholly-owned subsidiary of the Company, which may be a Domestic Subsidiary or a Foreign Subsidiary."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Subsidiary (a) that is a Designated Borrower or (b) that is a significant subsidiary of the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Subsidiary or Affiliate of the Administrative Agent or the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each notice pursuant to this Section shall be accompanied by a statement of a Responsible Officer of the Company or applicable Subsidiary."&lt;SEP&gt;"Such Person and its Affiliates may accept deposits from, lend money to, own securities of, act as the financial advisor or in any other advisory capacity for and generally engage in any kind of business with any Borrower or any Subsidiary or other Affiliate thereof."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company may at any time, upon not less than 10 Business Days’ notice from the Company to the Administrative Agent, designate any additional Subsidiary of the Company as a Designated Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company or any Subsidiary fails to pay any Material Indebtedness within five days of the date such payment is due"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subsidiary is a borrower under the credit agreement and is required to provide Information to the Administrative Agent and the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subsidiary is a company that is owned or controlled by the Company, and the Lenders may have rights and interests in the Subsidiary under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The motivations of the Administrative Agent are commercial in nature and not to invest in the general performance or operations of the Company or any Subsidiary."&lt;SEP&gt;"a Subsidiary of the Company"&lt;SEP&gt;"a company that is controlled or owned by another company, such as the Company."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fc71017c2caaab37d172ceaf0e09b388e1dce067cbd68e8f1e99012d931b5fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22018e046e6afa039b6c5519ad4d3d2a187b5ee53945844568160c46abb9f6a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2e35c49fdc82fe469355cd3f4a7d66ac4e1caf86823c8a1f714e6758a00f72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c65f8a967b6bdd468f8d3ea6d9afb81ef856d6ad36a5e2c1c2eaa04dd03306c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70e66841da77e158232fc791da7ba5c83a7a4e366d94c2a604edc34cc9b427fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d284a32dc973551dd3a95e067c7a7e4ca65ed5fc4b8b9af49298c1a4ab4c8738&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14e8e3cfeec76b5832426da03fd19e479d7aaf6c8a4f22b76860a34f613b7219&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b382365636e7d7745a443218cd6b4521b203ff098b36b45bf2b0ac9d851d876&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f235e3aaffeb5cbfa776ab6ea080fa76cc39f67d3014cd035759653e27770f28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e46c87d01183b816db97187ef0ddad992ef24a5a3b2007491295020387a02c4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09e9c5e5b8a7a8f4ad5eb675c75b46dfea2876894f750bdb96a586997b962e8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cf30aa371483ffc5e424225ef332db8adf37eeb6519c28e0905154c67a5e75e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d34bfe4b8431df4ba4815a275fd36ac0a378cd81d05748dd022697a48707a14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39903c506f2ed6e3becee13eaa6df530fdd376a6533c5d81ffd839e61ab1166c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be37345534a10dfd61be5c6f2fb19d9fc32937b5ae726a29f739cc850797b27a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e06203a764e8d9f36c5cbaca7bc8741843d94e91ddf0b7cc99ff68067bbc1a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff14b04e79a66fbfb8528158967e7f8c27d18cd00c1753f7623ec5b24aeafbe6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXTENSION CLOSING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
