  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The rate per annum that is added to the base rate benchmark to determine the final interest rate on the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"the applicable interest rate used to calculate the Default Rate"&lt;SEP&gt;"the rate at which interest is calculated on the outstanding principal amount of a loan"&lt;SEP&gt;"with respect to Base Rate Loans, 0.00% per annum, with respect to Term Benchmark Loans and RFR Loans, 0.45% per annum and with respect to the commitment fee set forth in Section 2.07(a), 0.03% per annum."</data>
