  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"MNPI has the meaning specified in Section 6.02."&lt;SEP&gt;"MNPI refers to material non-public information, which is sensitive information that is not publicly available."&lt;SEP&gt;"Material Non-Public Information, which refers to sensitive information that is not publicly available and is subject to certain regulations and handling procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"all Borrower Materials will be treated as private and may contain material nonpublic information with respect to the Company or its securities for purposes of United States federal and state securities Laws (“MNPI”);"</data>
