  <data key="d1">"The Company provides a guaranty to the Lender, guaranteeing the obligations of the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c7db0278db53932718c0ec9229e65778e4ed2f8d1c18cc7df9db844e9044f91d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PREPAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PREPAYMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Prepayment refers to the repayment of the loan by the borrower before the scheduled maturity date."&lt;SEP&gt;"A provision that allows the borrower to repay part or all of the loan before the scheduled maturity date, often subject to specific fees or penalties as outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A provision that allows the borrower to repay part or all of the loan before the scheduled maturity date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Borrower may, upon notice to the Administrative Agent from such Borrower, at any time or from time to time voluntarily prepay any Borrowing in whole or in part without premium or penalty."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2a31d91e19f5e79dee072438030f29981db72d5f3569150ff42952e39d103036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f736f0f97ea6ab8151aec215e65bbd3572402809b6e7b043f3c8ba68ed651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a164963b51c81b4b7d5b333e9db2c3903e435b22d1b0a8d407e7203d895bb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BASE RATE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of loan facility where the interest rate is determined by reference to a Base Rate, which may not include the Term SOFR component."&lt;SEP&gt;"Base Rate Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each borrowing of or conversion to Base Rate Loans or RFR Loans shall be in an aggregate amount that is an integral multiple of the Borrowing Multiple and not less than the Borrowing Minimum."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans denominated in US Dollars may be Base Rate Loans,"&lt;SEP&gt;"a type of loan that uses the Base Rate as the benchmark rate"&lt;SEP&gt;"a type of loan with an interest rate based on the base rate"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0e8dd65b0bdcd2760aee8bbedd800f7746b7142b5f61618f2af7cedb31ba6ce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f736f0f97ea6ab8151aec215e65bbd3572402809b6e7b043f3c8ba68ed651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2790a1002a49b097b09cbc3582891a9773c9dc0da7cb8ba9d83655fb70f7699&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21e8bd401eb8d2893cda3131348d5d8ecee9345959902e114ca131d8e2d1d670&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f945709d114cee142af65ee864299dd933046f3d5c2c59a4f7e3b675e775a0db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWING MULTIPLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MARGIN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Each borrowing of, conversion to or continuation of Term Benchmark Loans shall be in an aggregate amount that is an integral multiple of the Borrowing Multiple and not less than the Borrowing Minimum."&lt;SEP&gt;"any prepayment of a Borrowing shall be in an aggregate amount that is an integral multiple of the Borrowing Multiple and not less than the Borrowing Minimum or, if less, the entire principal amount of such Borrowing then outstanding."&lt;SEP&gt;"the multiple of the minimum amount for a Borrowing, varying by type of loan and currency"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f945709d114cee142af65ee864299dd933046f3d5c2c59a4f7e3b675e775a0db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a164963b51c81b4b7d5b333e9db2c3903e435b22d1b0a8d407e7203d895bb0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
