<node id="&quot;TERM BENCHMARK LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of loan that is based on a benchmark interest rate, such as LIBOR."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan with a fixed interest rate, often used as a benchmark for other loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each borrowing of, conversion to or continuation of Term Benchmark Loans shall be in an aggregate amount that is an integral multiple of the Borrowing Multiple and not less than the Borrowing Minimum."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term Benchmark Loans are a type of Loan that is based on a benchmark interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term Benchmark Loans are a type of loan that is based on a benchmark interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term Benchmark Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Upon the Company’s receipt of notice of the commencement of a Benchmark Unavailability Period, the applicable Borrower may revoke any request for the borrowing of, conversion to or continuation of any Term Benchmark Loans or RFR Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"a type of loan with an interest rate based on a term benchmark"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-036c3af469107c12ccd7233c14b709806175fda0a66a8e3643eda71a416404ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e8dd65b0bdcd2760aee8bbedd800f7746b7142b5f61618f2af7cedb31ba6ce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c57ca3d4b6f13c7bd1c48724f58fb0dc9179a0eb8a9db37f727f6e9c7bcca0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeefb9b088abc8d89a40d93af5939ed01899b461f9a1e8dbd62765acc3ca0f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e48532ee920b5375a652dc8e8d0fdfd2761dd7785efd024ee1ed1feb0d9303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a34ec7ffc5432911519463a4d806edde9566d8d3383aef9f37db8ac12227f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f945709d114cee142af65ee864299dd933046f3d5c2c59a4f7e3b675e775a0db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Business Day is a day on which banks are open for business in the jurisdiction where the Loan is made."&lt;SEP&gt;"A business day is a day on which business is conducted, excluding weekends and holidays."&lt;SEP&gt;"A day on which banks and other financial institutions are open for business."&lt;SEP&gt;"A day on which banks are open for business in the jurisdiction where the credit agreement is governed."&lt;SEP&gt;"A day on which banks are open for business in the relevant financial market."&lt;SEP&gt;"A detailed timeline that outlines key dates and deadlines related to the credit agreement, including repayment dates, interest payment intervals, and compliance milestones."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent has not received, by 5:00 p.m., New York City time, on the fifth Business Day after the date of the Term CORRA Notice, written notice of objection to such conversion to Term CORRA from Lenders comprising the Required Lenders or from the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Business Day refers to the days on which the Lenders are open for business."&lt;SEP&gt;"a day on which banks are open for business"&lt;SEP&gt;"a day on which banks are open for business."&lt;SEP&gt;"a day on which businesses are open and able to conduct transactions"&lt;SEP&gt;"any day other than a Saturday, a Sunday or any other day on which commercial banks are authorized to remain closed under the Laws of, or are in fact closed in, New York City, New York, with additional conditions for specific currencies"&lt;SEP&gt;"any prepayment of a Borrowing shall be in an aggregate amount that is an integral multiple of the Borrowing Multiple and not less than the Borrowing Minimum or, if less, the entire principal amount of such Borrowing then outstanding, on the Business Day specified in the applicable Loan Notice."&lt;SEP&gt;"from time to time on any Business Day during the Availability Period;"&lt;SEP&gt;"the rate of exchange used shall be that at which in accordance with normal banking procedures the Administrative Agent could purchase the first currency with such other currency on the Business Day preceding that on which final judgment is given."&lt;SEP&gt;"the requested date of the borrowing, conversion or continuation, as the case may be (which shall be a Business Day)."&lt;SEP&gt;"unless, in the case of an Interest Period of one month or longer, such Business Day falls in another calendar month, in which case such Interest Period shall end on the next preceding Business Day"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-036c3af469107c12ccd7233c14b709806175fda0a66a8e3643eda71a416404ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ff8bbfb0e9e2a8305cb863cbeecde68558028aed4c696e7b848831bc7f03992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4c601fe8f9d4d8b25c08bf113b5bf96ae2574679bd1e9086048018d2759a602&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e48532ee920b5375a652dc8e8d0fdfd2761dd7785efd024ee1ed1feb0d9303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf0b74c9fd54d4358be6da80ee3ca58034fd87424426a3d8e4a476fecd29b1f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a9c6ebe9b09f0c3d719105cd8ced9a6a8b5cdc9b6070153b8c9d8082f94c0d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc8c23279d4b40492da900adf3d7ce05f507b7160f15801f9294d5e8cdc3d00c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a164963b51c81b4b7d5b333e9db2c3903e435b22d1b0a8d407e7203d895bb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2790a1002a49b097b09cbc3582891a9773c9dc0da7cb8ba9d83655fb70f7699&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21e8bd401eb8d2893cda3131348d5d8ecee9345959902e114ca131d8e2d1d670&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e46c87d01183b816db97187ef0ddad992ef24a5a3b2007491295020387a02c4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48de9c0c4ee7fbda3257454472e1f74bc0487f3f3bb847feab2a439c61845295&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d34bfe4b8431df4ba4815a275fd36ac0a378cd81d05748dd022697a48707a14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50c8db37c43d3f2580ae0f2d2a37e258761568ad254938243b61070df4eb971e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f945709d114cee142af65ee864299dd933046f3d5c2c59a4f7e3b675e775a0db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff14b04e79a66fbfb8528158967e7f8c27d18cd00c1753f7623ec5b24aeafbe6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33cb52d5337eb942b4ed3da0d48ee32399c0e0869d20193c317a8a2c3a06049</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
