<node id="&quot;RELATED PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"RELATED PARTIES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Related Parties are entities that are affiliated with the Administrative Agent or the Lenders, and may have certain rights and obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Parties are individuals or entities that are affiliated with the Administrative Agent, Arranger, or Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent and any such sub-agent may perform any and all of its duties and exercise its rights and powers by or through their respective Related Parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Related Parties of the Lenders and the Administrative Agent are entities that are related to the Lenders and the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Related Parties refer to the affiliates and related entities of the Administrative Agent and the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"means, with respect to any Person, such Person’s Affiliates and the partners, directors, officers and employees (and, solely to the extent acting on behalf of or at the express instructions of any of the foregoing, agents and advisors of the foregoing) of such Person and of such Person’s Affiliates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a26b5126e4c1e707b1bbe422f1a41e0d0cc8063a093ce84f380bccb1d3545594&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70e66841da77e158232fc791da7ba5c83a7a4e366d94c2a604edc34cc9b427fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-405e30a8247fa3f574e4cf704c4da2490c7b07557815fff2ebf7de66149d000a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be37345534a10dfd61be5c6f2fb19d9fc32937b5ae726a29f739cc850797b27a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e06203a764e8d9f36c5cbaca7bc8741843d94e91ddf0b7cc99ff68067bbc1a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd537df50e1543242e0c0db7ea536b0f7035562c9c32eb98a80dcee483914b78</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERM CORRA LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOAN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of Loan that bears interest at a term CORRA rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"a Loan that bears interest at a rate based on the Term CORRA."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c610acc60b313ab2f0cb1618c5c144d079538d57f099e41f83a5a06f84e38ca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a9c6ebe9b09f0c3d719105cd8ced9a6a8b5cdc9b6070153b8c9d8082f94c0d7</data>
