<node id="&quot;SUBROGATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal, legally binding contract outlining the rights, obligations, and terms between two or more parties. In a credit context, it details the financing arrangement, including terms of borrowing, repayment schedules, interest rates, and collateral."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company shall not exercise any right of subrogation, contribution, indemnity, reimbursement or similar rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guarantor has the right of subrogation, and may seek reimbursement from the Borrower for any amounts paid to the Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c7db0278db53932718c0ec9229e65778e4ed2f8d1c18cc7df9db844e9044f91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aced5e6c50ac288864430fbe72ab45e09b7a3926dd8018932cd2f67b078cb7d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50c8db37c43d3f2580ae0f2d2a37e258761568ad254938243b61070df4eb971e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ASSIGNEE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A person or entity that receives the rights and obligations of another party through an assignment."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that receives rights or obligations under the credit agreement through a transfer from the original party. The assignee assumes the transferred responsibilities or benefits as defined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that receives rights or obligations under the credit agreement through a transfer from the original party."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Assignee is the entity that receives the rights and obligations of a Lender under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a26b5126e4c1e707b1bbe422f1a41e0d0cc8063a093ce84f380bccb1d3545594&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-287e1de5e659a7178eed8c39f284e89d7d984ce914fef63cc2925dcee357efee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289994a26d84c67345cf65b52990c0b3561f3b44f50b2737f538f26b785bc8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d83e1d187f97b9d479a02987af469379777e335a03f2f4a566b855662bde5347&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d34bfe4b8431df4ba4815a275fd36ac0a378cd81d05748dd022697a48707a14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56521f0d5861a7f4d9b333237148742c844e3d8c2104929a676973533b40aca</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RFR LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A structured credit or loan arrangement outlined in the agreement, in this case, loans whose interest is determined by reference to a Relevant Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan that is based on a risk-free rate, such as SOFR."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each borrowing of or conversion to Base Rate Loans or RFR Loans shall be in an aggregate amount that is an integral multiple of the Borrowing Multiple and not less than the Borrowing Minimum."&lt;SEP&gt;"RFR Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Upon the Company’s receipt of notice of the commencement of a Benchmark Unavailability Period, the applicable Borrower may revoke any request for the borrowing of, conversion to or continuation of any Term Benchmark Loans or RFR Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"a type of loan with an interest rate based on a risk-free rate"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-036c3af469107c12ccd7233c14b709806175fda0a66a8e3643eda71a416404ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e8dd65b0bdcd2760aee8bbedd800f7746b7142b5f61618f2af7cedb31ba6ce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeefb9b088abc8d89a40d93af5939ed01899b461f9a1e8dbd62765acc3ca0f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f736f0f97ea6ab8151aec215e65bbd3572402809b6e7b043f3c8ba68ed651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f945709d114cee142af65ee864299dd933046f3d5c2c59a4f7e3b675e775a0db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ERISA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A law that governs and regulates employee benefit plans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any of the events set forth in Section 4043(c) of ERISA, other than events for which the 30-day notice period has been waived."&lt;SEP&gt;"ERISA is a regulatory body that oversees pension plans and other employee benefit plans."&lt;SEP&gt;"ERISA is a regulatory entity that governs employee benefit plans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974, a federal law that regulates pension and welfare benefit plans, including those related to credit agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974, as amended."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974, which regulates pension plans."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974, a federal law regulating employee benefit plans"&lt;SEP&gt;"the Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974, as amended, and the rules and regulations promulgated thereunder"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b0b12585f6502351b0e84ecc60e47e6640828e4339d67c9b7a3c5084dcdb713&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22018e046e6afa039b6c5519ad4d3d2a187b5ee53945844568160c46abb9f6a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2e35c49fdc82fe469355cd3f4a7d66ac4e1caf86823c8a1f714e6758a00f72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6e8743e0fed11cf1e7302388e7b8f38f70918d5b087d464be884bffcad84ea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4126b4b4c0ad66505c7d9dd64d6916e9aae5e634b3890281c7177c2b0e53a84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d284a32dc973551dd3a95e067c7a7e4ca65ed5fc4b8b9af49298c1a4ab4c8738&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-683730b045acd1f370fdaed2c7829337a50090b5804d74bf2b26500077b12189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f235e3aaffeb5cbfa776ab6ea080fa76cc39f67d3014cd035759653e27770f28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
