<node id="&quot;TERM CORRA NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NOTICE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Administrative Agent has delivered to the Lenders and the Company a Term CORRA Notice, and so long as the Administrative Agent has not received, by 5:00 p.m., New York City time, on the fifth Business Day after the date of the Term CORRA Notice, written notice of objection to such conversion to Term CORRA from Lenders comprising the Required Lenders or from the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"the notification by the Administrative Agent to the Lenders and the Company of the occurrence of a Term CORRA Transition Event."</data>
