<node id="&quot;TRANSFEROR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TRANSFEROR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The party that transfers its rights or interests in the credit agreement to another entity. This often occurs in loan trading or syndication, where parts of the loan are sold to different institutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The party that transfers its rights or interests in the credit agreement to another entity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-287e1de5e659a7178eed8c39f284e89d7d984ce914fef63cc2925dcee357efee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289994a26d84c67345cf65b52990c0b3561f3b44f50b2737f538f26b785bc8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d83e1d187f97b9d479a02987af469379777e335a03f2f4a566b855662bde5347&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889</data>
