</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICANT BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Company may at any time, upon not less than 10 Business Days’ notice from the Company to the Administrative Agent, designate any additional Subsidiary of the Company as a Designated Borrower, which is referred to as an Applicant Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Applicant Borrower as defined in Section 2.14(a)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0e8dd65b0bdcd2760aee8bbedd800f7746b7142b5f61618f2af7cedb31ba6ce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c65f8a967b6bdd468f8d3ea6d9afb81ef856d6ad36a5e2c1c2eaa04dd03306c</data>
