</node>
<node id="&quot;CODE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A document that sets out the laws and regulations that apply to financial institutions in the United States."&lt;SEP&gt;"If any Borrower or the Administrative Agent shall be required by the Code to withhold or deduct any Taxes, including both United States Federal backup withholding and withholding taxes, from any payment, then (A) the Administrative Agent shall withhold or make such deductions as are determined by the Administrative Agent to be required based upon the information and documentation it has received pursuant to subsection (e) below,"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Code refers to the US tax code, which includes regulations such as FATCA."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Internal Revenue Code, which regulates pension plans and other employee benefits."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Internal Revenue Code of 1986, as amended"&lt;SEP&gt;"the Internal Revenue Code of the United States, which includes Sections 1471 through 1474 related to FATCA."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Internal Revenue Code, a federal law regulating taxation"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b0b12585f6502351b0e84ecc60e47e6640828e4339d67c9b7a3c5084dcdb713&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c610acc60b313ab2f0cb1618c5c144d079538d57f099e41f83a5a06f84e38ca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6e8743e0fed11cf1e7302388e7b8f38f70918d5b087d464be884bffcad84ea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14e8e3cfeec76b5832426da03fd19e479d7aaf6c8a4f22b76860a34f613b7219&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5df97a15cda855416ef6ff0ebbf7aa9f54e1229c4f8fa6db6f23ed463e738ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7176cf30b46b0b2bd028f692a631973b82ef94973df4a23df2be2494830423d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPORTABLE EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"an event that must be reported to the PBGC"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b0b12585f6502351b0e84ecc60e47e6640828e4339d67c9b7a3c5084dcdb713</data>
