<node id="&quot;TERM CORRA TRANSITION DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"If a Term CORRA Transition Event and its related Term CORRA Transition Date have occurred, then on and after such Term CORRA Transition Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"the date that is set forth in the Term CORRA Notice for the replacement of the then-current Benchmark with respect to Canadian Dollars."</data>
