<node id="&quot;LOAN DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">The LOAN DOCUMENT is a formal, legally binding contract that outlines the terms and conditions of a loan, including the credit agreement, between two or more parties, typically the borrowers and lenders. It details the financing arrangement, including terms of borrowing, repayment schedules, interest rates, and collateral. The LOAN DOCUMENT refers to the credit agreement and other documents related to the loan, such as notes and security agreements, and includes all renewals, extensions, amendments, refinancings, and other modifications thereof. The document is a type of agreement that outlines the rights, obligations, and terms between the Company and the Lenders, or the Borrower and the Lender, and is considered a legally binding contract. Any payments made by or on account of any obligation of any Borrower under any LOAN DOCUMENT shall be made without deduction or withholding for any Taxes, except as required by applicable Laws. The LOAN DOCUMENT also includes provisions for submission to jurisdiction and waiver of venue, and declares the unpaid principal amount of all outstanding Loans, all interest accrued and unpaid thereon, and all other amounts owing or payable under the LOAN DOCUMENT or any other related document. The Administrative Agent shall not be responsible for or have any duty to ascertain or inquire into any statement, warranty, or representation made in or in connection with the LOAN DOCUMENT or any other related document, and shall only have duties or obligations expressly set forth in the LOAN DOCUMENT and other related documents. Overall, the LOAN DOCUMENT is a comprehensive and legally binding contract that outlines the terms and conditions of a loan, and is a critical component of the lending process.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-25153dfc8542779016754e3a9d4ba1ff761fe00f9d01723cf4b526a3637e8e65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-405e30a8247fa3f574e4cf704c4da2490c7b07557815fff2ebf7de66149d000a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e06203a764e8d9f36c5cbaca7bc8741843d94e91ddf0b7cc99ff68067bbc1a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56521f0d5861a7f4d9b333237148742c844e3d8c2104929a676973533b40aca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4c601fe8f9d4d8b25c08bf113b5bf96ae2574679bd1e9086048018d2759a602&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63858fdc1fc34af26e481d6c4df137e48430e981c53ec2578449a748506facd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf0b74c9fd54d4358be6da80ee3ca58034fd87424426a3d8e4a476fecd29b1f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b382365636e7d7745a443218cd6b4521b203ff098b36b45bf2b0ac9d851d876&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2facca2c062c9b7ce891849070758dd3706fef511167f7acb4748b321c724e7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-036c3af469107c12ccd7233c14b709806175fda0a66a8e3643eda71a416404ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ca8d6a181a8bde7e3dabd1b9b58a0f7ae55346ce1eece1febe781b49afbd657&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289994a26d84c67345cf65b52990c0b3561f3b44f50b2737f538f26b785bc8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22018e046e6afa039b6c5519ad4d3d2a187b5ee53945844568160c46abb9f6a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc8c23279d4b40492da900adf3d7ce05f507b7160f15801f9294d5e8cdc3d00c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5df97a15cda855416ef6ff0ebbf7aa9f54e1229c4f8fa6db6f23ed463e738ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7176cf30b46b0b2bd028f692a631973b82ef94973df4a23df2be2494830423d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09e9c5e5b8a7a8f4ad5eb675c75b46dfea2876894f750bdb96a586997b962e8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd537df50e1543242e0c0db7ea536b0f7035562c9c32eb98a80dcee483914b78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c65f8a967b6bdd468f8d3ea6d9afb81ef856d6ad36a5e2c1c2eaa04dd03306c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d284a32dc973551dd3a95e067c7a7e4ca65ed5fc4b8b9af49298c1a4ab4c8738&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2790a1002a49b097b09cbc3582891a9773c9dc0da7cb8ba9d83655fb70f7699&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e46c87d01183b816db97187ef0ddad992ef24a5a3b2007491295020387a02c4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5eca3d410c6e7af1c12511c011937aecc77644104b8212bfaf1761e84d991a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39903c506f2ed6e3becee13eaa6df530f