<node id="&quot;DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">DEFAULT refers to an event where the borrower, or in some cases the company or lender, fails to meet their respective payment obligations or comply with the terms of the credit agreement. This failure can include non-repayment of the loan, non-payment of interest, or non-compliance with covenants as outlined in the agreement. When a DEFAULT occurs, it serves as a penalty and an incentive for the borrower to maintain timely payments. In the event of a DEFAULT, the lender may apply a higher interest rate, known as default interest, and may also claim collateral. The Administrative Agent plays a crucial role in managing DEFAULT situations, including determining the status of a Defaulting Lender and taking actions in response to an Event of Default. The company or borrower is required to notify the Administrative Agent and each Lender of the occurrence of any DEFAULT, and the Administrative Agent is deemed not to have knowledge of any DEFAULT unless and until written notice is given. DEFAULT can trigger various actions, including the Administrative Agent taking steps at the request of, or with the consent of, the Required Lenders. The representations and warranties made by the company or borrower continue to be relied upon by the Administrative Agent and each Lender, regardless of any investigation made or notice of DEFAULT. Overall, DEFAULT is a critical concept in credit agreements, highlighting the importance of meeting payment obligations and complying with the terms of the agreement to avoid penalties and potential legal consequences.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fc71017c2caaab37d172ceaf0e09b388e1dce067cbd68e8f1e99012d931b5fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c57ca3d4b6f13c7bd1c48724f58fb0dc9179a0eb8a9db37f727f6e9c7bcca0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a05f2d3762035b6920e2994449915a10f14de2b16d9908fab1975c1279ab5fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56521f0d5861a7f4d9b333237148742c844e3d8c2104929a676973533b40aca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-287e1de5e659a7178eed8c39f284e89d7d984ce914fef63cc2925dcee357efee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064d8dd62757d82b1f21029d116981d33cf5047c69e28a4c7441d90f0d506fa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09e9c5e5b8a7a8f4ad5eb675c75b46dfea2876894f750bdb96a586997b962e8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2790a1002a49b097b09cbc3582891a9773c9dc0da7cb8ba9d83655fb70f7699&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e46c87d01183b816db97187ef0ddad992ef24a5a3b2007491295020387a02c4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5eca3d410c6e7af1c12511c011937aecc77644104b8212bfaf1761e84d991a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a31d91e19f5e79dee072438030f29981db72d5f3569150ff42952e39d103036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39903c506f2ed6e3becee13eaa6df530fdd376a6533c5d81ffd839e61ab1166c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be37345534a10dfd61be5c6f2fb19d9fc32937b5ae726a29f739cc850797b27a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-405e30a8247fa3f574e4cf704c4da2490c7b07557815fff2ebf7de66149d000a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeefb9b088abc8d89a40d93af5939ed01899b461f9a1e8dbd62765acc3ca0f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd758a235fa3762ad9b4aad4608ccd04d2283533e76b28c157982eac1454264</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
