<node id="&quot;CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">The CREDIT AGREEMENT is a formal, legally binding contract that outlines the rights, obligations, and terms between two or more parties, typically a lender and a borrower. In the context of Amazon.com, Inc., the CREDIT AGREEMENT is a contract between the company and various lenders, including JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A., Banco Bilbao Vizcaya Argentaria, S.A., The Toronto-Dominion Bank, New York Branch, CITIBANK, N.A., Bank of China, Los Angeles Branch, and Wells Fargo Bank, N.A., among others. The agreement details the financing arrangement, including terms of borrowing, repayment schedules, interest rates, and collateral. It is a type of loan agreement that governs the credit facility, including revolving credit agreements, and outlines the terms and conditions of the loan, including the rights and obligations of the parties involved. The CREDIT AGREEMENT is a structured credit or loan arrangement that provides a framework for the lender and borrower to operate within, and it is the document that outlines the terms and conditions of the loan. Overall, the CREDIT AGREEMENT is a comprehensive contract that provides a clear understanding of the credit arrangement between the parties involved, and it is a crucial document in the lending process.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9271415b6fffe0893502dc89e3841c2be9f06f82c8c5f9489abaefaec90483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aa609ce53c934cf0d4d4925a1dc81b3274e7a1c7f3122ebf103aa191c09b5c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26b5126e4c1e707b1bbe422f1a41e0d0cc8063a093ce84f380bccb1d3545594&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7db0278db53932718c0ec9229e65778e4ed2f8d1c18cc7df9db844e9044f91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1fe0d130929db1808cc1753b17c948318cb87081241f82a4da21261bb1ad76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fb172fdc7dd11aa8c4301cdb41f98671b3363e4d4e757604b6708b833b2bf51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99fca5514203c82284d615b343bef86be2508efddc2c338557ba897c36b9419f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeefb9b088abc8d89a40d93af5939ed01899b461f9a1e8dbd62765acc3ca0f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f3af823220981638c48fc83a90df748a59607384581d6688401c7c9cd5c1fd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c6571d7017e85d1e7eca3e535c4971d4e40eee95a434accc5984191595984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33bc80bf5077096a2a0b1e25dbb756b80db0d7d6596bcf7e3624d144b203f443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf0b74c9fd54d4358be6da80ee3ca58034fd87424426a3d8e4a476fecd29b1f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c32dd616613b7cde01b80f0ad638cff031a46b8683d1644af6b23cceff4eae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45129efc91c185030848e31c5d56e89153e563c756c35b25bf656e474bf2d270&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48de9c0c4ee7fbda3257454472e1f74bc0487f3f3bb847feab2a439c61845295&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a34ec7ffc5432911519463a4d806edde9566d8d3383aef9f37db8ac12227f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b0b12585f6502351b0e84ecc60e47e6640828e4339d67c9b7a3c5084dcdb713&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be25a46cca3a79843b2c8a4c855abca0c524be4f23bd13985d7ed013c2da3408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a7cb2d32a014cbd8ecc96746c516faa8445dc4c74435c9e1e7a4b3dcc4bbf48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-913dc70008f5f7c8ec790c2d3c3bf56a7ce9ae659f1beb24fec703fc8ec5fb18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27b7bb1eab2f386df30221441b52db7bbd2cb70270996232684fd82d606dc333&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289994a26d84c67345cf65b52990c0b3561f3b44f50b2737f538f26b785bc8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b45c39f8acaf016fee44b9459f40033ecb5aa4c524d9ae5b4a5ca68270b67321&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6e8743e0fed11cf1e7302388e7b8f38f70918d5b087d464be884bffcad84ea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e0e7b47c7a4918aaa35cad78939f047c0807effe52b5147840dfb42902551a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f235e3aaffeb5cbfa776ab6ea080fa76cc39f67d3014cd035759653e27770f28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14e8e3cfeec76b5832426da03fd19e479d7aaf6c8a4f22b76860a34f613b7219&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4dd848570043f1ce9e6de38d8ba9c86222a9c152a2809befbd0a785a3e278609&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a4816968ed32808241c34bb92596fb7f2401d39587ed67758b4ba7b99610321&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50c8db37c43d3f2580ae0f2d2a37e258761568ad254938243b61070df4eb971e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5df97a15cda855416ef6ff0ebbf7aa9f54e1229c4f8fa6db6f23ed463e738ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4178a4ad671267bcd9dbab4c7b03f8c052305752de5653f7e6ff47babde72c0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057f1dfd340055780e8531fd368d9afb8a7c5c552bfd91fcbb9d77cfe6ad88db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-328112be8eae1ba952b0aba11f7a67d95621188d8c343d98d4aa81c51337af27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9e5415fdefa5d7b60b532bf240d882cd80d500e82755b28327141429bd737a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-619d0161bc5810a5abb25244b72fa59da189e925c4b29d39e99929dde9dc342e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54c6a4cbf8e57f371d8b0ff6bf25001a1063300fe0c9ec5397ddb98d526bc8df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-287e1de5e659a7178eed8c39f284e89d7d984ce914fef63cc2925dcee357efee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdb367995e1f9dcb1b41ec5b6e071da48069b4f221492206865b14037b15cec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d83e1d187f97b9d479a02987af469379777e335a03f2f4a566b855662bde5347&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d284a32dc973551dd3a95e067c7a7e4ca65ed5fc4b8b9af49298c1a4ab4c8738&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064d8dd62757d82b1f21029d116981d33cf5047c69e28a4c7441d90f0d506fa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5eca3d410c6e7af1c12511c011937aecc77644104b8212bfaf1761e84d991a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd758a235fa3762ad9b4aad4608ccd04d2283533e76b28c157982eac1454264</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
