<node id="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">The Lenders are financial institutions or entities that provide loans or credit to the Company or borrowers. They are responsible for disbursing funds and monitoring compliance with the credit agreement. The Lenders have appointed the Administrative Agent to manage the loan documents and represent them in the transaction. Each Lender has certain rights and obligations under the agreement, including the maintenance of confidentiality of information and the authority to set off and apply any deposits or obligations against the obligations of the Company or any other borrower. The Lenders are required to provide loans pursuant to the terms of the credit agreement and are subject to the requirements of the USA PATRIOT Act. A group of Lenders, comprising more than 50% of the Total Credit Exposures of all Lenders, are considered to be the Required Lenders, and their approval is necessary for certain actions, such as conversion to Term CORRA. The Administrative Agent notifies the Lenders of any requests, notices of termination or reduction of the Aggregate Commitments, and determines whether the requested Interest Period is acceptable to all of them. The Lenders agree to receive loans and provide credit to the Company, subject to the terms and conditions of the credit agreement, and are authorized to take certain actions, including setting off and applying deposits or obligations, to ensure compliance with the agreement. Overall, the Lenders play a crucial role in providing financial support to the Company and are responsible for ensuring that the terms of the credit agreement are met.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-683730b045acd1f370fdaed2c7829337a50090b5804d74bf2b26500077b12189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a31d91e19f5e79dee072438030f29981db72d5f3569150ff42952e39d103036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e06203a764e8d9f36c5cbaca7bc8741843d94e91ddf0b7cc99ff68067bbc1a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c57ca3d4b6f13c7bd1c48724f58fb0dc9179a0eb8a9db37f727f6e9c7bcca0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c6571d7017e85d1e7eca3e535c4971d4e40eee95a434accc5984191595984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf0b74c9fd54d4358be6da80ee3ca58034fd87424426a3d8e4a476fecd29b1f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2facca2c062c9b7ce891849070758dd3706fef511167f7acb4748b321c724e7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc654eb29e972ffacdcbd1b1689d14682e8ad53b669e5b7b8a2de0e843401cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a34ec7ffc5432911519463a4d806edde9566d8d3383aef9f37db8ac12227f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33cb52d5337eb942b4ed3da0d48ee32399c0e0869d20193c317a8a2c3a06049&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-036c3af469107c12ccd7233c14b709806175fda0a66a8e3643eda71a416404ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70e66841da77e158232fc791da7ba5c83a7a4e366d94c2a604edc34cc9b427fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b366223ffce1d243cf104dd968c58e4e03ce0ef2716ea0865cb3ed376a6e0bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-279401c1a592881eefdbd927f41151f279903f6314ebe85d3fb4bab5d68a081e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc8c23279d4b40492da900adf3d7ce05f507b7160f15801f9294d5e8cdc3d00c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057f1dfd340055780e8531fd368d9afb8a7c5c552bfd91fcbb9d77cfe6ad88db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec7874b9697abfa7fdec5c3eba7cff86c0d83eb6bd59405831eed85588e963df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a3d2b24cfcf893da9826354352f4a7639afec65277f7fddb2b7adfc118840d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-523b7c35f39a59c5cfa19ecb52fd1a59b812fc7d6cb057106fe0660553c4d72c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c65f8a967b6bdd468f8d3ea6d9afb81ef856d6ad36a5e2c1c2eaa04dd03306c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-243cf92c11d25bde5e4778831027cd7c49ba52026095b54d99e7210645194a56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f945709d114cee142af65ee864299dd933046f3d5c2c59a4f7e3b675e775a0db</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">The Borrower, in this case, Amazon.com, Inc., is an individual, company, or legal entity that receives funds under the credit agreement and is responsible for repaying the loan according to the agreed terms, including any interest and fees. As the borrower, Amazon.com, Inc. may request loans in a currency other than US Dollars and is obligated to repay the loans in accordance with the terms of the agreement. The Borrower is the party that receives the loan and is responsible for repaying it, and in the event of a failure to make payment by the Lender, the Borrower shall repay the Loan to the Administrative Agent with interest. The Borrower's obligations include making payments without deduction or withholding for any Taxes, except as required by applicable Laws, and incurring liability that results in a Material Adverse Effect as a result of the occurrence of any ERISA Event. The Borrower's responsibilities also include executing and delivering a Note to the assignee Lender upon request, and ensuring that all representations and warranties contained in the credit agreement are true and correct in all material respects. The Administrative Agent shall make all funds received available to the Borrower in like funds as received, either by crediting the Borrower's account or by wire transfer. Overall, the Borrower, Amazon.com, Inc., plays a crucial role in the credit agreement, and its responsibilities and obligations are clearly outlined in the terms of the agreement.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b285e03d7146f17e87848eb9b5f8c15183dec4084105eaa7e79c1ad84c91367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25153dfc8542779016754e3a9d4ba1ff761fe00f9d01723cf4b526a3637e8e65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26b5126e4c1e707b1bbe422f1a41e0d0cc8063a093ce84f380bccb1d3545594&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7db0278db53932718c0ec9229e65778e4ed2f8d1c18cc7df9db844e9044f91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1fe0d130929db1808cc1753b17c948318cb87081241f82a4da21261bb1ad76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e48532ee920b5375a652dc8e8d0fdfd2761dd7785efd024ee1ed1feb0d9303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-683730b045acd1f370fdaed2c7829337a50090b5804d74bf2b26500077b12189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-405e30a8247fa3f574e4cf704c4da2490c7b07557815fff2ebf7de66149d000a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeefb9b088abc8d89a40d93af5939ed01899b461f9a1e8dbd62765acc3ca0f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f3af823220981638c48fc83a90df748a59607384581d6688401c7c9cd5c1fd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfab8e567e4b2e5380b905a1150a53c7223642e58e7a7f29499f7f19b9bed867&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4c601fe8f9d4d8b25c08bf113b5bf96ae2574679bd1e9086048018d2759a602&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c6571d7017e85d1e7eca3e535c4971d4e40eee95a434accc5984191595984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2e35c49fdc82fe469355cd3f4a7d66ac4e1caf86823c8a1f714e6758a00f72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b382365636e7d7745a443218cd6b4521b203ff098b36b45bf2b0ac9d851d876&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a164963b51c81b4b7d5b333e9db2c3903e435b22d1b0a8d407e7203d895bb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48de9c0c4ee7fbda3257454472e1f74bc0487f3f3bb847feab2a439c61845295&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26e39a9e3ce38e35ba80037cbf39058662ce1dbd88dd87d6a9a695b35bb692f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a34ec7ffc5432911519463a4d806edde9566d8d3383aef9f37db8ac12227f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b0b12585f6502351b0e84ecc60e47e6640828e4339d67c9b7a3c5084dcdb713&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc3aeda4c8edfd097445eb549ccb4a90e255e5a840b3e4e803abe3a81e80fda1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be25a46cca3a79843b2c8a4c855abca0c524be4f23bd13985d7ed013c2da3408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a7cb2d32a014cbd8ecc96746c516faa8445dc4c74435c9e1e7a4b3dcc4bbf48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-913dc70008f5f7c8ec790c2d3c3bf56a7ce9ae659f1beb24fec703fc8ec5fb18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289994a26d84c67345cf65b52990c0b35