<node id="&quot;LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">LOAN is a type of financing provided by the Lenders to the Company, specifically a borrowing of funds under the credit agreement. It is a structured credit or loan arrangement outlined in the agreement, defining the specific financing structure, including terms of borrowing, repayment schedules, interest rates, and collateral. This type of credit facility allows a borrower to borrow money from a lender, providing a specific amount of funds for a defined period of time, subject to certain terms and conditions. The Loan is made by the Lender to the Borrower through the Administrative Agent and refers to the amount borrowed under the credit agreement, as well as the credit facility provided to the Company and its Subsidiary. In the case of AMAZON.COM, INC., the credit agreement provides a loan facility, which may be in the form of a term loan, revolving credit, or other type of loan. The interest rate on a Loan may be derived from an interest rate benchmark, and the interest paid or agreed to be paid under the Loan Documents shall not exceed the maximum rate of non-usurious interest permitted by applicable Law. The Loan is a type of facility provided by the lender, providing financing to the borrower, and is a type of debt instrument used to raise funds. Each Lender may make any Loan to a Borrower through any Lending Office, and the obligation of each Borrower is to repay the Loans in accordance with the terms of the Agreement. The Administrative Agent is not responsible for or have any duty to ascertain or inquire into any statement, warranty, or representation made in or in connection with the Agreement or any other Loan Document. Overall, LOAN is a financial arrangement where a lender provides funds to a borrower, with the expectation of repayment, and is a crucial aspect of the credit agreement between the Lender and the Borrower.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-25153dfc8542779016754e3a9d4ba1ff761fe00f9d01723cf4b526a3637e8e65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1fe0d130929db1808cc1753b17c948318cb87081241f82a4da21261bb1ad76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e48532ee920b5375a652dc8e8d0fdfd2761dd7785efd024ee1ed1feb0d9303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21e8bd401eb8d2893cda3131348d5d8ecee9345959902e114ca131d8e2d1d670&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a31d91e19f5e79dee072438030f29981db72d5f3569150ff42952e39d103036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e06203a764e8d9f36c5cbaca7bc8741843d94e91ddf0b7cc99ff68067bbc1a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeefb9b088abc8d89a40d93af5939ed01899b461f9a1e8dbd62765acc3ca0f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56521f0d5861a7f4d9b333237148742c844e3d8c2104929a676973533b40aca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dff3b153ec45df711dfc884145e6bd8e5c94c750ec4b6a3dfc30192713432e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c57ca3d4b6f13c7bd1c48724f58fb0dc9179a0eb8a9db37f727f6e9c7bcca0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a05f2d3762035b6920e2994449915a10f14de2b16d9908fab1975c1279ab5fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33bc80bf5077096a2a0b1e25dbb756b80db0d7d6596bcf7e3624d144b203f443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26e39a9e3ce38e35ba80037cbf39058662ce1dbd88dd87d6a9a695b35bb692f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33cb52d5337eb942b4ed3da0d48ee32399c0e0869d20193c317a8a2c3a06049&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b0b12585f6502351b0e84ecc60e47e6640828e4339d67c9b7a3c5084dcdb713&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc3aeda4c8edfd097445eb549ccb4a90e255e5a840b3e4e803abe3a81e80fda1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289994a26d84c67345cf65b52990c0b3561f3b44f50b2737f538f26b785bc8b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b45c39f8acaf016fee44b9459f40033ecb5aa4c524d9ae5b4a5ca68270b67321&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22018e046e6afa039b6c5519ad4d3d2a187b5ee53945844568160c46abb9f6a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e0e7b47c7a4918aaa35cad78939f047c0807effe52b5147840dfb42902551a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff14b04e79a66fbfb8528158967e7f8c27d18cd00c1753f7623ec5b24aeafbe6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50c8db37c43d3f2580ae0f2d2a37e258761568ad254938243b61070df4eb971e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057f1dfd340055780e8531fd368d9afb8a7c5c552bfd91fcbb9d77cfe6ad88db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09e9c5e5b8a7a8f4ad5eb675c75b46dfea2876894f750bdb96a586997b962e8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec7874b9697abfa7fdec5c3eba7cff86c