<node id="&quot;PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">The PERSON is an individual or entity that may be involved in a credit agreement, serving as an Administrative Agent or having other roles under the Loan Documents. They can be a party to the credit agreement or otherwise involved in the transaction, and may include individuals, companies, corporations, partnerships, joint ventures, limited liability companies, or other business entities. A PERSON has the capacity to own or control securities and can enter into contracts or agreements. They may receive funds under the credit agreement and be responsible for repaying the loan, including any interest and fees. The term PERSON refers to any individual, corporation, partnership, association, trust, unincorporated organization, government, or political subdivision that is capable of entering into a contract or agreement. This includes any natural person, corporation, limited liability company, trust, joint venture, association, company, partnership, Governmental Authority, or other entity that can enter into a capital lease or has a monetary obligation under a synthetic lease. The PERSON may also be a party to the Loan Documents, and any individual or entity that is a party to the agreement, including the borrower and the lender, is considered a PERSON. Additionally, any individual, company, or other legal entity involved in or affected by the credit agreement is also referred to as a PERSON. The Administrative Agent, who may be a PERSON, has the same rights and powers as any other Lender and may exercise them as though it were not the Administrative Agent. Overall, the term PERSON encompasses a broad range of individuals and entities that can participate in credit agreements, own securities, and enter into contracts, and is a key concept in the context of credit agreements and Loan Documents.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9271415b6fffe0893502dc89e3841c2be9f06f82c8c5f9489abaefaec90483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b285e03d7146f17e87848eb9b5f8c15183dec4084105eaa7e79c1ad84c91367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e48532ee920b5375a652dc8e8d0fdfd2761dd7785efd024ee1ed1feb0d9303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-405e30a8247fa3f574e4cf704c4da2490c7b07557815fff2ebf7de66149d000a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21e8bd401eb8d2893cda3131348d5d8ecee9345959902e114ca131d8e2d1d670&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-652de4f4d91e90a6f7563949dee043c59ebc83c69af5a7e4daaf8634d33d43cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e425af2e275bc52ded23404cc180bda000dd6a0c5f29625d84cb283b1e6497a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56521f0d5861a7f4d9b333237148742c844e3d8c2104929a676973533b40aca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-243cf92c11d25bde5e4778831027cd7c49ba52026095b54d99e7210645194a56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4c601fe8f9d4d8b25c08bf113b5bf96ae2574679bd1e9086048018d2759a602&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b382365636e7d7745a443218cd6b4521b203ff098b36b45bf2b0ac9d851d876&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48de9c0c4ee7fbda3257454472e1f74bc0487f3f3bb847feab2a439c61845295&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b0b12585f6502351b0e84ecc60e47e6640828e4339d67c9b7a3c5084dcdb713&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ca8d6a181a8bde7e3dabd1b9b58a0f7ae55346ce1eece1febe781b49afbd657&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70e66841da77e158232fc791da7ba5c83a7a4e366d94c2a604edc34cc9b427fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff14b04e79a66fbfb8528158967e7f8c27d18cd00c1753f7623ec5b24aeafbe6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a9c6ebe9b09f0c3d719105cd8ced9a6a8b5cdc9b6070153b8c9d8082f94c0d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd537df50e1543242e0c0db7ea536b0f7035562c9c32eb98a80dcee483914b78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c8ccb9ae0ce6b50448d0662187cdebe651dfc72a75e420e155916a8d69201a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1307fb50714aaa5c54a16511ecdafdda1e867cd79f4bdc3f2e60bf7361349b09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a3d2b24cfcf893da9826354352f4a7639afec65277f7fddb2b7adfc118840d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e46c87d01183b816db97187ef0ddad992ef24a5a3b2007491295020387a02c4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffa333ba0635dfede67f8ea5e9914c4783139c8fc1ab497336bf6f481fabdc91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d34bfe4b8431df4ba4815a275fd36ac0a378cd81d05748dd022697a48707a14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39903c506f2ed6e3becee13eaa6df530fdd376a6533c5d81ffd839e61ab1166c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be37345534a10dfd61be5c6f2fb19d9fc32937b5ae726a29f739cc850797b27a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3635abde8c7e5a6f484e19948315859a2e2ed6f744a89175ad7f5758f30b40f1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">The COMPANY is a legal business entity or corporation that engages in commercial, industrial, or professional activities. It is the borrower under the credit agreement and is responsible for repaying the loan according to the agreed terms, including any interest and fees. The COMPANY may be a corporation, partnership, joint venture, limited liability company, or other business entity, and it is often referred to as the borrower or the parent company of the borrower. As the borrower, the COMPANY is entitled to receive funds under the credit agreement and is obligated to make payments to the lenders through the Administrative Agent. The COMPANY has the right to replace certain lenders and designate additional subsidiaries as borrowers, and it is required to provide information to the Administrative Agent and the lenders. The COMPANY is also responsible for complying with the terms of the loan documents and is subject to various types of liens and encumbrances that may affect its property or assets. In the event of a default, the COMPANY may be required to pay additional fees and expenses, and it may be subject to certain restrictions and limitations on its activities. Overall, the COMPANY is the primary entity involved in the credit agreement and is responsible for repaying the loan and complying with the terms of the agreement. The COMPANY's obligations and rights are outlined in the credit agreement, and it is required to work with the Administrative Agent and the lenders to ensure that the terms of the agreement are met.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9271415b6fffe0893502dc89e3841c2be9f06f82c8c5f9489abaefaec90483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b285e03d7146f17e87848eb9b5f8c15183dec4084105eaa7e79c1ad84c91367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25153dfc8542779016754e3a9d4ba1ff761fe00f9d01723cf4b526a3637e8e65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26b5126e4c1e707b1bbe422f1a41e0d0cc8063a093ce84f380bccb1d3545594&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7db0278db53932718c0ec9229e65778e4ed2f8d1c18cc7df9db844e9044f91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e48532ee920b5375a652dc8e8d0fdfd2761dd7785efd024ee1ed1feb0d9303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-652de4f4d91e90a6f7563949dee043c59ebc83c69af5a7e4daaf8634d33d43cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a31d91e19f5e79dee072438030f29981db72d5f3569150ff42952e39d103036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e06203a764e8d9f36c5cbaca7bc8741843d94e91ddf0b7cc99ff68067bbc1a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeefb9b088abc8d89a40d93af5939ed01899b461f9a1e8dbd62765acc3ca0f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e425af2e275bc52ded23404cc180bda000dd6a0c5f29625d84cb283b1e6497a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56521f0d5861a7f4d9b333237148742c844e3d8c2104929a676973533b40aca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c57ca3d4b6f13c7bd1c48724f58fb0dc9179a0eb8a9db37f727f6e9c7bcca0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a05f2d3762035b6920e2994449915a10f14de2b16d9908fab1975c1279ab5fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63858fdc1fc34af26e481d6c4df137e48430e981c53ec2578449a748506facd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2e35c49fdc82fe469355cd3f4a7d66ac4e1caf86823c8a1f714e6758a00f72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf0b74c9fd54d4358be6da80ee3ca58034fd87424426a3d8e4a476fecd29b1f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b382365636e7d7745a443218cd6b4521b203ff098b36b45bf2b0ac9d851d876&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a164963b51c81b4b7d5b333e9db2c3903e435b22d1b0a8d407e7203d895bb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48de9c0c4ee7fbda3257454472e1f74bc0487f3f3bb847feab2a439c61845295&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc654eb29e972ffacdcbd1b1689d14682e8ad53b669e5b7b8a2de0e843401cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cf30aa371483ffc5e424225ef332db8adf37eeb6519c28e0905154c67a5e75e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2facca2c062c9b7ce891849070758dd3706fef511167f7acb4748b321c724e7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26e39a9e3ce38e35ba80037cbf39058662ce1dbd88dd87d6a9a695b35bb692f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a34ec7ffc5432911519463a4d806edde