<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">28.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent is responsible for complying with the regulations and laws imposed by the Governmental Authority, and the Governmental Authority is responsible for overseeing and enforcing compliance with laws and regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent shall timely pay the full amount withheld or deducted to the relevant Governmental Authority in accordance with the Code."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Regulatory Compliance, Administrative Responsibilities"&lt;SEP&gt;"Tax payment, Regulatory compliance, Administrative duties"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-3d5eca3d410c6e7af1c12511c011937aecc77644104b8212bfaf1761e84d991a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7176cf30b46b0b2bd028f692a631973b82ef94973df4a23df2be2494830423d</data>
