</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">39.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is subject to the laws and regulations enforced by the Governmental Authority, which may impact the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrowers shall timely pay to the relevant Governmental Authority in accordance with applicable law, or at the option of the Administrative Agent timely reimburse it for the payment of, any Other Taxes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Governmental Authority has the authority to require the Borrower to provide evidence of payments and to withhold taxes if necessary."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Tax payment, Regulatory compliance, Financial obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"regulatory, borrower, credit agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"taxation, regulation"</data>
