  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Termination or Reduction of Commitments refers to the lender's right to terminate or reduce their commitment to provide financing under the credit agreement, which is outlined in the Commitments section."</data>
  <data key="d6">"commitment, termination, reduction"</data>
