</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMITMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">32.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commitments refer to the lenders' legally binding promise to provide financing up to a specified amount under certain conditions, which is outlined in the Loans facility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loans and Commitments are related to the Agreement."</data>
