  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loans are made by Lenders to Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides the Loans to the Borrower under the credit agreement."::&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender shall make the Loans hereunder, including the enforcement or protection of rights under this Agreement and the other Loan Documents."</data>
