  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Maturity Date is the predetermined final due date for the repayment of the loan, which signals the end of the loan term, when all outstanding principal and accrued interest must be repaid, as outlined in the Loans facility."</data>
  <data key="d6">"repayment, loan term, maturity"</data>
