  <data key="d4">19.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Credit Agreement is subject to the applicable Law, and the parties must comply with the relevant regulations and rules."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Law refers to the applicable laws and regulations that govern the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The credit agreement is governed by and subject to the laws, rules, and regulations that govern credit agreements and financial transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">"governance, regulation, compliance"&lt;SEP&gt;"law, compliance"&lt;SEP&gt;"law, regulation, agreement"</data>
