  <data key="d5">"Waiver of jury trial is a clause that waives the right to a jury trial in case of disputes."</data>
  <data key="d6">"waiver, jury, trial"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;ADVISORY OR FIDUCIARY RESPONSIBILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Advisory or fiduciary responsibility is a clause that clarifies the level of responsibility or duty owed by one party to another."</data>
  <data key="d6">"advisory, fiduciary, responsibility"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;REPLACEMENT OF LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Replacement of lenders is the process of substituting one lender with another."</data>
  <data key="d6">"replacement, lender, party"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;CONFIDENTIALITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Confidentiality is the obligation to keep certain information private and not disclose it to others."</data>
  <data key="d6">"confidential, private, information"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;RIGHT OF SETOFF&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Right of setoff is the right to offset or deduct one obligation against another."</data>
  <data key="d6">"setoff, offset, obligation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Credit Agreement is the contract that outlines the terms and conditions of the loan, including the rights and obligations of the parties involved."::</data>
  <data key="d6">"contract, agreement"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-a26b5126e4c1e707b1bbe422f1a41e0d0cc8063a093ce84f380bccb1d3545594</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Notices are official communications or notifications between parties."</data>
  <data key="d6">"communication, notification, party"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;WAIVER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A waiver is a formal decision to relinquish or forego a known right or claim under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"relinquish, forego, right"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;LIMITATION OF LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Limitation of liability is a clause that restricts the amount of liability or damages that can be claimed."</data>
  <data key="d6">"liability, damages, restriction"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;INTEREST RATE LIMITATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Interest rate limitation is a cap or limit on the interest rate that can be charged."</data>
  <data key="d6">"interest, rate, limitation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Expenses are costs or expenditures incurred by parties in relation to the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"cost, expenditure, party"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENTS SET ASIDE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Payments set aside are payments that are withheld or not made due to certain conditions or circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">"payment, withhold, condition"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;INDEMNITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Indemnity is a guarantee or assurance to compensate for losses or damages."</data>
  <data key="d6">"guarantee, assurance, loss"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0637512e9683af0950e352a2ae06119a2f2427d2785a7c4c13b856a2fd9db889</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUB-AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent may perform any and all of its duties and exercise its rights and powers hereunder or under any other Loan Document by or through any one or more sub-agents appointed by the Administrative Agent."</data>
  <data key="d6">"agency, duties, powers"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-be37345534a10dfd61be5c6f2fb19d9fc32937b5ae726a29f739cc850797b27a</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUB-AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;RELATED PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent and any such sub-agent may perform any and all of its duties and exercise its rights and powers by or through their respective Related Parties."</data>
  <data key="d6">"related parties, duties, powers"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-be37345534a10dfd61be5c6f2fb19d9fc32937b5ae726a29f739cc850797b27a</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAXES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrowers are responsible for withholding Taxes as provided in Section 3.01 of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"taxation, withholding, compliance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-2ff8bbfb0e9e2a8305cb863cbeecde68558028aed4c696e7b848831bc7f03992</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAXES&quot;" target="&quot;CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Taxes are fees or charges imposed by governments on individuals or entities, which are excluded from Section 3.04 and governed exclusively by Section 3.01 of the Credit Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"tax, credit agreement, regulatory"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-eeefb9b088abc8d89a40d93af5939ed01899b461f9a1e8dbd62765acc3ca0f5c</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAXES&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 3.01&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 3.01 specifies the requirements for withholding Taxes."</data>
  <data key="d6">"covenants, taxes"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-ec7874b9697abfa7fdec5c3eba7cff86c0d83eb6bd59405831eed85588e963df</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAXES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is obligated to pay all taxes and other governmental charges when due."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must comply with tax laws and regulations, and may be subject to tax liabilities and obligations."::</data>
  <data key="d6">"obligation, payment"&lt;SEP&gt;"taxes, regulatory, compliance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c7db0278db53932718c0ec9229e65778e4ed2f8d1c18cc7df9db844e9044f91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22018e046e6afa039b6c5519ad4d3d2a187b5ee53945844568160c46abb9f6a3</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BENCHMARK REPLACEMENT DATE&quot;" target="&quot;BENCHMARK UNAVAILABILITY PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"the Benchmark Unavailability Period begins at the time of a Benchmark Replacement Date and ends when a Benchmark Replacement is in effect"</data>
  <data key="d6">"benchmark replacement, loan terms"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-3ef432fa7c25d170dedf14289fd215751752a0e76cbec62a317d4633b0f9c944</data>
