</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF COMPETENT JURISDICTION&quot;" target="&quot;CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court of Competent Jurisdiction refers to the court that has the authority to hear and decide cases related to the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"court, jurisdiction, agreement"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-cc8c23279d4b40492da900adf3d7ce05f507b7160f15801f9294d5e8cdc3d00c</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
