</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF COMPETENT JURISDICTION&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent may need to interact with a Court of Competent Jurisdiction in the event of a dispute related to the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"regulatory, dispute resolution"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-2a31d91e19f5e79dee072438030f29981db72d5f3569150ff42952e39d103036</data>
