  <data key="d4">21.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 11.04 refers to the specific promises or restrictions included in the agreement that govern the Company's operations and financial behavior."</data>
  <data key="d6">"covenants, agreement, governance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-cc8c23279d4b40492da900adf3d7ce05f507b7160f15801f9294d5e8cdc3d00c</data>
