  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Daily Simple SOFR is used as a base rate benchmark for RFR Loans denominated in US Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Daily Simple SOFR is used as a base rate benchmark for RFR Loans."</data>
