  <data key="d4">27.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The NYFRB determines the Overnight Bank Funding Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Overnight Bank Funding Rate is determined by the NYFRB."</data>
  <data key="d6">"NYFRB, overnight bank funding rate, determination"&lt;SEP&gt;"rate, determination, NYFRB"</data>
