</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">34.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower shall execute and deliver a Note to the assignee Lender upon request"&lt;SEP&gt;"The note is a debt security instrument that outlines the terms of the loan, including the principal amount, interest rate, and repayment terms, and the borrower is responsible for repaying the loan according to the agreed terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">"borrower, note, lender"&lt;SEP&gt;"loan terms, repayment, obligations"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-1307fb50714aaa5c54a16511ecdafdda1e867cd79f4bdc3f2e60bf7361349b09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a7cb2d32a014cbd8ecc96746c516faa8445dc4c74435c9e1e7a4b3dcc4bbf48</data>
