  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The form of note is a template or example of a note that the borrower may use to evidence the loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">"note, template, example"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-3a7cb2d32a014cbd8ecc96746c516faa8445dc4c74435c9e1e7a4b3dcc4bbf48</data>
