</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REQUIRED LENDERS&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">22.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"During the existence of an Event of Default, upon the request of the Required Lenders, (i) no Loans denominated in US Dollars shall be converted to or continued as Term Benchmark Loans without the consent of the Required Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Upon receipt of any such notice of resignation, the Required Lenders shall have the right, with the written consent of the Company, to appoint a successor."</data>
  <data key="d6">"appointment, successor, consent"&lt;SEP&gt;"lending, consent, event of default"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-be37345534a10dfd61be5c6f2fb19d9fc32937b5ae726a29f739cc850797b27a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a164963b51c81b4b7d5b333e9db2c3903e435b22d1b0a8d407e7203d895bb0</data>
