<edge source="&quot;ASSIGNMENT AND ASSUMPTION&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">39.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Lender uses the Assignment and Assumption document to assign their rights and obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The assignment and assumption agreement transfers the rights and obligations of a loan from one party to another, often used in loan syndications or assignments, and the lender is responsible for managing the administrative aspects of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"assignment, transfer"&lt;SEP&gt;"loan syndication, assignment, transfer"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-7f9271415b6fffe0893502dc89e3841c2be9f06f82c8c5f9489abaefaec90483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a7cb2d32a014cbd8ecc96746c516faa8445dc4c74435c9e1e7a4b3dcc4bbf48</data>
