<edge source="&quot;RELEVANT GOVERNMENTAL BODY&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">39.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent determines the recommendation of the Relevant Governmental Body."::&lt;SEP&gt;"The Relevant Governmental Body oversees and enforces laws related to credit agreements, which are administered by the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Relevant Governmental Body oversees the activities of the Administrative Agent."::&lt;SEP&gt;"The Relevant Governmental Body provides recommendations for the replacement of the Benchmark, which the Administrative Agent considers in its determination."</data>
  <data key="d6">"determination, recommendation"&lt;SEP&gt;"oversight"&lt;SEP&gt;"oversight, administration"&lt;SEP&gt;"regulation, recommendation"</data>
