<edge source="&quot;DESIGNATED BORROWER REQUEST AND ASSUMPTION AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The designated borrower request and assumption agreement allows a designated borrower to assume the obligations of a loan, subject to certain terms and conditions, and the borrower is responsible for repaying the loan according to the agreed terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">"loan assumption, obligations, repayment"</data>
