<edge source="&quot;LOAN DOCUMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">50.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent is responsible for managing the Loan Documents"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages the Loan Documents on behalf of the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent or any Lender may from time to time reasonably request additional information regarding the financial condition of the Company or any Borrower’s compliance with the terms of the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent shall administer the Loan Documents, including this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent shall enforce the Loan Documents and ensure compliance with the terms and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"electronic images of this Agreement or any other Loan Documents shall have the same legal effect, validity and enforceability as any paper original, and the Administrative Agent is under no obligation to agree to accept electronic signatures."</data>
