<edge source="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Defaulting Lender is a Lender that is in default of its obligations under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent may determine that any Lender is a Defaulting Lender, or the effective date of such status."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender may become a Defaulting Lender if they fail to meet their obligations under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"default, determination, status"&lt;SEP&gt;"default, obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"default, risk"</data>
