  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">32.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Defaulting Lender is a Lender that has failed to perform its obligations under the Loan Documents, and the other Lenders may take action against it."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Defaulting Lender is a Lender that has failed to perform its obligations under this Agreement, and is subject to certain restrictions and limitations, including the loss of voting rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Defaulting Lender is a lender that has failed to fund its portion of a loan, and the other Lenders may be affected by this default."</data>
  <data key="d6">"lender, credit agreement, default"&lt;SEP&gt;"lending, credit agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"loan participation, default risk"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-70e66841da77e158232fc791da7ba5c83a7a4e366d94c2a604edc34cc9b427fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a31d91e19f5e79dee072438030f29981db72d5f3569150ff42952e39d103036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-279401c1a592881eefdbd927f41151f279903f6314ebe85d3fb4bab5d68a081e</data>
