  <data key="d4">20.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Recipient (often the Lender or Administrative Agent) may receive refunds of taxes and is obligated to pay these refunds to the Borrower under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Recipient receives payments from the Borrower."::</data>
