<edge source="&quot;DESIGNATED BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Designated Borrower is a Subsidiary that is designated as a borrower under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Designated Borrower is a specific borrower designated under the credit agreement, subject to certain conditions and requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"before and after giving effect to such extension (A) the representations and warranties contained in Article V (and, in the case of a Designated Borrower, in its Designated Borrower Request and Assumption Agreement) are true and correct in all material respects"</data>
  <data key="d6">"borrowing, representation, warranty"&lt;SEP&gt;"designated borrower, borrower, credit agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"designation, borrowing"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-4a34ec7ffc5432911519463a4d806edde9566d8d3383aef9f37db8ac12227f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25153dfc8542779016754e3a9d4ba1ff761fe00f9d01723cf4b526a3637e8e65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2e35c49fdc82fe469355cd3f4a7d66ac4e1caf86823c8a1f714e6758a00f72</data>
