<edge source="&quot;DESIGNATED BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">42.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Designated Borrower is responsible for repaying the loan to the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lender has the right to bring actions, litigation, or proceedings against the designated borrower in the New York State Court or the United States District Court of the Southern District of New York."</data>
  <data key="d6">"lending, jurisdiction"&lt;SEP&gt;"loan, repayment, credit agreement"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-63858fdc1fc34af26e481d6c4df137e48430e981c53ec2578449a748506facd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeefb9b088abc8d89a40d93af5939ed01899b461f9a1e8dbd62765acc3ca0f5c</data>
