  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If any payment by or on behalf of any Designated Borrower or the Company is made, or any of the Credit Parties exercises its right of setoff, in respect of the Obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">"borrowing, payment, obligations"</data>
