  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWERS&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">72.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent coordinates with the Borrowers to facilitate payments and ensure compliance with the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is under no obligation to agree to accept electronic signatures in any form or in any format unless expressly agreed to by it, and each Borrower shall provide all Regulatory Information that the Administrative Agent or such Lender requests."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent notifies the Borrowers at any time that the Total Outstandings at such time exceed an amount equal to 105% of the Aggregate Commitments then in effect."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrowers are obligated to indemnify the Administrative Agent against any Indemnified Taxes, and the Administrative Agent is responsible for managing the administrative aspects of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Administrative Agent, Borrowers, Regulatory Information"&lt;SEP&gt;"Indemnification, Administrative Responsibilities"&lt;SEP&gt;"coordination, payment, compliance"&lt;SEP&gt;"notification, loan management"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-3d5eca3d410c6e7af1c12511c011937aecc77644104b8212bfaf1761e84d991a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b366223ffce1d243cf104dd968c58e4e03ce0ef2716ea0865cb3ed376a6e0bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ff8bbfb0e9e2a8305cb863cbeecde68558028aed4c696e7b848831bc7f03992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33cb52d5337eb942b4ed3da0d48ee32399c0e0869d20193c317a8a2c3a06049</data>
