<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">146.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Company can have a Subsidiary"&lt;SEP&gt;"A Subsidiary is a company controlled by another company"&lt;SEP&gt;"Each notice pursuant to this Section shall be accompanied by a statement of a Responsible Officer of the Company or applicable Subsidiary."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company and the Subsidiary have a relationship where they are required to provide Information to the Administrative Agent and the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is the parent company of the Subsidiary, and the Subsidiary is a wholly-owned subsidiary of the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company may designate any additional Subsidiary of the Company as a Designated Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company or any Subsidiary fails to pay any Material Indebtedness within five days of the date such payment is due"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company or any Subsidiary in an aggregate outstanding principal amount of $1,500,000,000 or more."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subsidiary is a company that is owned or controlled by the Company, and the Lenders may have rights and interests in the Subsidiary under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The company has a parent-subsidiary relationship with its subsidiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"The motivations of the Administrative Agent are commercial in nature and not to invest in the general performance or operations of the Company or any Subsidiary."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Company has Subsidiaries"</data>
  <data key="d6">"commercial, operations, performance"&lt;SEP&gt;"company, control"&lt;SEP&gt;"corporate structure, subsidiary"&lt;SEP&gt;"designation, subsidiary"&lt;SEP&gt;"information, borrower, obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"ownership, control"&lt;SEP&gt;"parent-subsidiary relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"parent-subsidiary, control"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-fc71017c2caaab37d172ceaf0e09b388e1dce067cbd68e8f1e99012d931b5fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c65f8a967b6bdd468f8d3ea6d9afb81ef856d6ad36a5e2c1c2eaa04dd03306c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2e35c49fdc82fe469355cd3f4a7d66ac4e1caf86823c8a1f714e6758a00f72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70e66841da77e158232fc791da7ba5c83a7a4e366d94c2a604edc34cc9b427fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f235e3aaffeb5cbfa776ab6ea080fa76cc39f67d3014cd035759653e27770f28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b382365636e7d7745a443218cd6b4521b203ff098b36b45bf2b0ac9d851d876&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e46c87d01183b816db97187ef0ddad992ef24a5a3b2007491295020387a02c4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09e9c5e5b8a7a8f4ad5eb675c75b46dfea2876894f750bdb96a586997b962e8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be37345534a10dfd61be5c6f2fb19d9fc32937b5ae726a29f739cc850797b27a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e06203a764e8d9f36c5cbaca7bc8741843d94e91ddf0b7cc99ff68067bbc1a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff14b04e79a66fbfb8528158967e7f8c27d18cd00c1753f7623ec5b24aeafbe6</data>
