  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Each borrowing of or conversion to Base Rate Loans or RFR Loans shall be in an aggregate amount that is an integral multiple of the Borrowing Multiple and not less than the Borrowing Minimum, and each borrowing of, conversion to or continuation of Term Benchmark Loans shall be in an aggregate amount that is an integral multiple of the Borrowing Multiple and not less than the Borrowing Minimum."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Term Benchmark Loans and RFR Loans are related in that they are both subject to the Benchmark Unavailability Period and the conversion to Term CORRA."</data>
