  <data key="d5">"The Assignee receives the rights and obligations of a Lender under the credit agreement, and the Lender assigns its rights and obligations to the Assignee."::&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender may assign its rights and obligations under the agreement to an Assignee."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender may transfer its rights or obligations under the credit agreement to an Assignee."::</data>
