<edge source="&quot;CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">32.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Company is party to the Credit Agreement and is responsible for complying with its terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Credit Agreement is an agreement between the Company and other parties that outlines the terms and conditions of the credit arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Credit Agreement governs the credit facility for the Company"</data>
  <data key="d6">"credit agreement, company, credit arrangement"&lt;SEP&gt;"credit agreement, company, facility"&lt;SEP&gt;"party, agreement"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-f6e8743e0fed11cf1e7302388e7b8f38f70918d5b087d464be884bffcad84ea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7db0278db53932718c0ec9229e65778e4ed2f8d1c18cc7df9db844e9044f91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14e8e3cfeec76b5832426da03fd19e479d7aaf6c8a4f22b76860a34f613b7219</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LENDERS&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">266.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Lenders to manage the credit agreement and ensure compliance with its terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Lenders"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent and the Lenders have a relationship where they agree to maintain the confidentiality of the Information and are authorized to set off and apply any deposits or obligations against the obligations of the Company or any other Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent informs the Lenders about the transactions contemplated hereby."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is appointed by the Lenders to act on their behalf and manage the loan documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is responsible for managing the administrative and operational aspects of the credit agreement on behalf of the Lenders, including fund disbursement, communication, and coordination among participants."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is under no obligation to agree to accept electronic signatures in any form or in any format unless expressly agreed to by it, and each Lender and the Administrative Agent hereby notifies the Borrowers that pursuant to the requirements of the USA PATRIOT Act."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages the administrative and operational aspects of the credit agreement on behalf of the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent shall give prompt notice to the Lenders of such request and determine whether the requested Interest Period is acceptable to all of them."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent shall send a notice to the Company and the Lenders specifying the effective date from and after which an Applicant Borrower shall constitute a Designated Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent will promptly notify the Company and the Lenders of any occurrence of a Benchmark Transition Event"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent will promptly notify the Lenders of any such notice of termination or reduction of the Aggregate Commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders and Administrative Agent work together to manage the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders appoint the Administrative Agent to manage the administrative and operational aspects of the credit agreement, including fund disbursement and communication among participants."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders have appointed the Administrative Agent to administer the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Administrative Agent, Lenders, USA PATRIOT Act"&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Request, Interest Period, Agent Notification"&lt;SEP&gt;"administration, agency"&lt;SEP&gt;"administrative agent, lenders, credit agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"agency, loan management"&lt;SEP&gt;"agency, management, coordination"&lt;SEP&gt;"agency, management, credit agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"agent, lender, administration"&lt;SEP&gt;"agent, lender, credit agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"confidentiality, setoff, obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"information, transaction, contemplation"&lt;SEP&gt;"management, credit agreement, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"notice, approval, designation"&lt;SEP&gt;"notification, benchmark transition event"&lt;SEP&gt;"notification, loan management"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-1c57ca3d4b6f13c7bd1c48724f58fb0dc9179a0eb8a9db37f727f6e9c7bcca0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e06203a764e8d9f36c5cbaca7bc8741843d94e91ddf0b7cc99ff68067bbc1a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a3d2b24cfcf893da9826354352f4a7639afec65277f7fddb2b7adfc118840d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c6571d7017e85d1e7eca3e535c4971d4e40eee95a434accc5984191595984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-523b7c35f39a59c5cfa19ecb52fd1a59b812fc7d6cb057106fe0660553c4d72c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c65f8a967b6bdd468f8d3ea6d9afb81ef856d6ad36a5e2c1c2eaa04dd03306c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf0b74c9fd54d4358be6da80ee3ca58034fd87424426a3d8e4a476fecd29b1f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc8c23279d4b40492da900adf3d7ce05f507b7160f15801f9294d5e8cdc3d00c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b366223ffce1d243cf104dd968c58e4e03ce0ef2716ea0865cb3ed376a6e0bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc654eb29e972ffacdcbd1b1689d14682e8ad53b669e5b7b8a2de0e843401cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-279401c1a592881eefdbd927f41151f279903f6314ebe85d3fb4bab5d68a081e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a34ec7ffc5432911519463a4d806edde9566d8d3383aef9f37db8ac12227f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f945709d114cee142af65ee864299dd933046f3d5c2c59a4f7e3b675e775a0db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33cb52d5337eb942b4ed3da0d48ee32399c0e0869d20193c317a8a2c3a06049&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e425af2e275bc52ded23404cc180bda000dd6a0c5f29625d84cb283b1e6497a6</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LENDERS&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">187.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Company and Lenders enter into a credit agreement, with the Lenders providing the loan and the Company responsible for repayment, and the Lenders acting as principals without advisory or fiduciary duties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company borrows from the Lenders, and the Lenders provide the Loans to the Company, with the Administrative Agent managing the administrative and operational aspects of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company borrows money from the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is obligated to repay the loan to the Lenders, and the Lenders have a security interest in the Company's assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is responsible for repaying the loan to the Lenders"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is the borrower under the credit agreement and is responsible for repaying the loan to the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company receives notice of the commencement of a Benchmark Unavailability Period, and the Lenders may object to the conversion to Term CORRA."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders and the Company have a relationship where the Lenders are authorized to set off and apply any deposits or obligations against the obligations of the Company or any other Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders have provided loans to the Company under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders provide the loan to the Company and have rights and interests in the Company under the Loan Documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">"borrowing, lending, repayment"&lt;SEP&gt;"credit agreement, loan, repayment"&lt;SEP&gt;"lending, borrowing"&lt;SEP&gt;"lending, credit agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"loan agreement, repayment, security interest"&lt;SEP&gt;"loan repayment, borrower-lender relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"loan, borrowing, Lenders"&lt;SEP&gt;"loan, credit agreement, borrower, lender"&lt;SEP&gt;"notice, objection, conversion"&lt;SEP&gt;"setoff, obligations, borrower"</data>
