<edge source="&quot;LENDERS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">91.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower receives funds from the Lenders and is responsible for repaying the loan according to the agreed terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders provide funds to the Borrower and monitor compliance with the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders provide funds to the Borrower under the credit agreement, and the Borrower is obligated to repay the loan with interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders provide the loan to the Borrower, and the Borrower is responsible for repaying the loan according to the agreed terms, including any interest and fees."&lt;SEP&gt;"The applicable Borrower may elect different conversion or continuation options with respect to different portions of the affected existing Borrowing, in which case each such portion shall be allocated ratably among the Lenders holding the Loans comprising such Borrowing."</data>
