<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">92.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Company is a Borrower under the credit agreement, and its obligations and rights are outlined in the agreement."::&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is often the Borrower in the credit agreement, receiving funds and being responsible for repayment."::&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is related to the Borrower, which receives written notice of determination from the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is the borrower in the credit agreement, responsible for repaying the loan according to the agreed terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company, as the borrower, is responsible for repaying the loan and complying with the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The company is the main borrower in the credit agreement."</data>
