<edge source="&quot;LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">258.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Company (Borrower) receives funds from the Lender and is obligated to repay the loan with interest, while the Lender provides the loan and monitors compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company and Lender have a relationship where the Lender provides the loan to the Company, and the Company is responsible for repaying the loan according to the agreed terms."::&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company borrows money from the Lender under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is required to deliver payments to the Lender, who provides the loan to the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company may, at its sole expense and effort, upon notice to such Lender and the Administrative Agent, require such Lender to assign and delegate, without recourse."::&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company or any Borrower’s compliance with the terms of the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company shall have the right to replace each Non-Extending Lender with one or more Eligible Assignees as provided in Section 11.13."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company shall indemnify the Lender against any and all Liabilities and related expenses incurred by the Lender in connection with the Loans made hereunder."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company shall promptly compensate (or cause the applicable Designated Borrower to promptly compensate) such Lender for and hold such Lender harmless from any loss (other than lost profit), cost or expense incurred by it"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender has a relationship with the Company where it provides a loan under the Credit Agreement."::&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides the loan to the Company, and the Company is responsible for repaying the loan according to the agreed terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides the loan to the Company, and the Company is responsible for repaying the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender shall receive interest in an amount that exceeds the Maximum Rate, the excess interest shall be applied to the principal of the Loans or, if it exceeds such unpaid principal, refunded to the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Lender provides the loan to the Company"</data>
